<|P>|i|≠|i, |i|≠|≠|a|p|i|ü|a|v|u|m, |e|≠|ü|a|t|a|≠|‡|l, "|k|ù|Ò|‡|p |p|u|k|a|©|m|‡|ü|a|≠|k|Â|Ò|a |l|a|≠|a|i|y|‡|Î|a|i,|‡|Ò|‡ |v|a|Ò|a|k|i|≠|u|Î|u|Ô |k|‡|ı|õ|≠|p|ù|r - |v|‡|Ò|‡|k, |k|a|r|u|Ô|k|o|l|v|õ|≠ |m|a|≠|≠|a|r |k|a|l|a|m|p|u|k|k|a|k|o|l|l|ù, |m|a|r|u|Ô|k|u|l|k|o|m |p|a|≠|≠|‡|ı |m|a|y|i|r" (|t|i|ı|a|i|m|‡. 4), "|m|a|i|y|‡|r |t|a|Ò|a|Ô|k|a|ı|m|a|y|i|l|a|≠|≠|‡|y |t|„|t|t|„|ı|Ò|u, |k|a|i|y|‡|r |p|i|r|i|v|i|t|t|a|l |k|‡|ı" (|t|i|ı|a|i|m|‡. 5), "|a|ü|ü|a|m|i|≠|ü|i |n|i|≠|ü|a|c|„|r|a|©|a|ü|p|e|y|a|r|p |p|u|ı|a|r|c|c|i|y|‡|≠, |m|u|ü|ü|u|m|u|≠ |c|a|Ò|i|p|p|e|y|a|r|m|Â|≠|ü|u|l|a|k|u |m|‡|≠|ü|e|©|a (|c|Â|Î|‡. |i|r|a|t|a. 19), "|a|≠|≠|a |m|a|≠|a|i|y|‡ |r|a|y|a|k|a|ı|Ò|a|≠|ü|õ|v|i|m|‡|r" (|c|Â|Î|‡. |a|r|a|c|i|y|a|ü, 339) |e|≠|a |i|v|v|‡|ü|u |v|a|r|u|v|a|≠|a|v|u|m, "|c|ù|l|a|i|y|a|i|y|ù|r|e|©|u|t|t|‡ |l|e|≠|c|o|l|l|u|n |t|o|k|k|a|t|a|≠|m|õ|l, |n|„|l|a|p|p|õ|r|e|v|v|e|©|u|t|t|i |≠|‡|≠|i|r|a|m|p|u -|m|‡|l|a|i|k, |k|u|Ò|a|i|v|õ|n|t|a|≠ |c|e|≠|≠|i |k|u|l|a|n|a|t|i|y|i|≠ |p|õ|r|a|i|k, |k|a|Ò|a|i|c|õ|r|n|t|a|v|ù|r|e|©|u|t|t|‡|ü |k|‡|ı" (|k|‡, |k|‡|v|i, |k|‡|v|i|r|i) |e|≠|a |i|v|v|‡|ü|u |e|©|u|t|t|u|p|p|e|r|u|k|k|a|m|‡|y|v|a|r|u|v|a|≠|a|v|u|m, "|‡|ü|ü|i|≠ |p|õ|r|„|ü|ü|i |≠|e|©|u|t|t|o|©|i|y|a |v|i|≠|p|a|§|c|õ|r, |n|‡|ü|k|‡|l|a |t|‡|m|„|ü|ü|u|y|i|r|n|a|Ò|a|p|p|a - |v|õ|ü|p|u|Ò|a|i|y|a, |u|ı|p|a|y|a|≠|‡ |m|‡|Ô|k|a|t|a|≠|i |≠|„|ü|o|©|i|n|t|‡ |l|ù|t|u|n|Â|ü,|k|i|≠|p|a|§|c|õ|r |c|e|y|y|u|Î|‡ |m|i|≠|ü|u" (|p|‡|l|‡|ü|u, |p|‡|l|‡, |p|‡|l, |p|‡) |i|v|v|‡|ü|u |e|©|u|t|t|u|c|c|u|r|u|k|k|a|m|‡|y |v|a|r|u|v|a|≠|a|v|u|m, "|v|‡|m|a |m|a|ı|i|m|õ |k|a|l|a|i|y|‡|r |m|a|y|a|r|k|u|ü|u|k|i,|≠|‡|m|a|v|a|r |p|e|y|y|u |m|a|ı|i|k|u|©|a|i - |õ|m|a, |m|a|y|i|r|n|i|ü|u|v|i |m|a|ü|ü|a|t|a|ü|k|ù|r |p|u|Î|Î|i|k|o|Ò|u|p|p|i|ü, |c|e|y|i|r|t|„|r |m|a|r|a|m|‡|k|u|§ |c|e|≠|ü|u" (|k|Â#|a|i|©|u, |k|u|©|a|i; |ù|t|i, |o|t|i)|i|v|v|‡|ü|u |m|‡|t|t|i|r|a|i|c|c|u|r|u|k|k|a|m|‡|y |v|a|r|u|v|a|≠|a|v|u|m, "|p|Â|m|õ|l|‡ |Î|‡|r|e|≠|p|‡|r|p|Â|m|p|ù|r|v|a|i |y|e|≠|c|e|y|y|u|m, |t|„|m|õ|ü |p|a|Ò|i|ü|k|o|Ò|u|t|t|‡|ü |k|o|Î|v|a|t|e|v|a - |≠|‡|m|õ, |n|a|l|a|n|t|i|k|a|©|u|§ |c|e|Ô|k|ù |≠|a|y|a|t|„|r|a |≠|e|Ô|k|ù|≠, |c|i|l|a|m|p|a|≠ |ü|i|r|u|v|õ|Ô|k|a|Ò|a|≠" |i|v|v|‡|ü|u|v|i|≠|‡|v|u|t|t|a|r|a|m|‡|y|v|a|r|u|v|a|≠|a|v|u|m, "|n|„|t|t|o|©|i|n|t|a |v|‡|ü|a|i|n|t|a|Ò|a|k|k|i|p|i|≠|≠|i|c|c|a|y|a|m|õ, |v|‡|y|t|t|a|m|a|i|n|t|a |v|‡|y|i|l|p|e|ı|ı|‡|≠|a|i|y|u|m - |k|Â|t|t|a|ü|k|u,|v|‡|Î|õ|ü|ù|Ò|ù|c|a|i |v|i|Î|a|i|n|i|l|a |m|i|v|v|a|l|l|‡|ü, |k|õ|Î|‡ |y|u|Ò|a|≠ |v|a|r|u|v|a|t|i|l"(|n|i|l|a|i|y|‡|m|a|i |k|a|Ò|a|i|p|p|i|Ò|i; |p|u|ı|ı|i|y|a|§|c|e|y), "|e|©|u|t|u|v|a|r|i|k |k|ù|l|a|t|t|‡ |r|„|v|‡|ü|k|u|r|i|y|‡|r, |t|o|©|u|t|i|m|a|i|y|‡|r |k|a|ı|ı|a|m|a|i|n|t|a |t|ù|Ò|Ò|‡|r - |p|a|©|u|t|a|k|a|l|a, |n|‡|ı|i|ü|c|e|ü|i|n|t|‡|r |n|a|l|a|Ô|k|i|Î|Î|i |n|‡|Ò|ù|ü|u|m, |p|õ|ı|a|ü |k|a|m|a|i|n|t|‡ |p|e|r|i|t|u" (|p|o|t|t|a|k|a|m)|[|t|o|l. |c|o|l. 449. |c|õ. |u|r|a|i|] |i|v|v|‡|ü|u |p|i|r|õ|Î|i|k|a|i|y|‡|y |v|a|r|u|v|a|≠|a|v|u|m|y|Â|k|i|p|p|a|y|i|ü|c|o|l|l|‡|y|v|a|r|u|v|a|≠|a|v|u|m |i|≠|≠|a|p|i|ü|a|v|u|m |k|u|ü|i|p|p|‡|ü|p|o|r|u|Î|u|ı|a|r|t|t|u|v|a|≠|a|v|‡|m|e|≠|a|k|k|o|Î|k|a.
|i|v|v|‡|ü|a|≠|ü|i,  |u|y|i|r |u|ı|a|r|v|u |u|Ò|a|m|p|u |t|a|l|a|i |k|a|ı |c|e|v|i |v|‡|y |m|Â|k|k|u |k|a|i |k|‡|l|c|ù|ü|u |k|Â|© |p|‡|l |p|‡|k|u |p|‡|Î|i|t|a|m |p|o|≠ |m|a|ı|i |m|u|t|t|u |n|i|l|a|m |n|„|r |m|a|r|a|m |k|a|m|u|k|u|t|e|Ô|k|u |y|‡|≠|a|i |k|u|t|i|r|a|i |o|≠|ü|u |i|r|a|ı|Ò|u |k|a|©|a|§|c|u |t|u|l|‡|m |n|‡|©|i |k|u|ü|u|ı|i|k|a|l|a|m|e|≠|a|v|u|m, "|n|a|l|l|‡ |ü|e|≠|a|p|p|a|Ò|u|v|a |t|i|y|‡|t|e|≠|i|≠ |y|‡|t|o|≠|ü|u|m, |k|o|l|l|‡|m|a|i |c|Â|©|u|n|e|ü|i" (|k|u|ü|a|Î. 324), "|o|r|u|k|a|i/|k|a|Ò |Ò|‡|≠ |k|a|ü|ü|a |k|a|l|l|i |y|o|r|u|v|a|ü,|k|e|©|u|m|a|i|y|u |m|õ|m|‡|p |p|u|Ò|a|i|t|t|u" (|k|u|ü|a|Î. 398) |e|≠|a|v|u|m |i|p|p|e|ü|ü|i|c|c|e|p|p|a|t|t|‡|ü|p|o|r|u|Î|t|a|r|u|v|a|≠|a|v|e|l|l|‡|m |v|e|Î|i|p|p|a|Ò|a|i|y|e|≠|a|k |k|o|Î|k|a.

