<|P><|B>((|W|F|W)):</|B> |m|õ|ü|k|Â|ü|a|p|p|a|Ò|Ò|a |c|o|l|l|õ, |i|y|a|ü|c|o|l |t|i|r|i|c|o|l|l|e|≠|≠|u|m|k|Â|ü|u|p|‡|Ò|Ò|‡|≠ |v|a|r|u|v|a|≠|a|v|‡|≠|a |p|e|y|a|r|c|c|o|l|l|u|m, |v|i|≠|a|i|c|c|o|l|l|u|m|e|≠|a |i|r|a|ı|Ò|‡|m;|i|Ò|a|i|c|c|o|l|l|u|m |u|r|i|c|c|o|l|l|u|m|e|≠|≠|u|m |i|v|v|i|r|a|ı|Ò|u|Ô|k|Â|Ò|a |n|‡|≠|k|u |k|Â|ü|u|p|‡|Ò|Ò|a|t|‡|m;|t|i|c|a|i|c|c|o|l|l|u|m |v|a|Ò|a|c|o|l|l|u|m |k|Â|Ò|‡|t|a|v|i|Ò|a|t|t|u |e-|ü|u.

<|P><|B>((|V|I|R|I)):</|B> |i|t|a|≠|‡|ü|p|ù|n|t|a|p|o|r|u|Î, |p|e|y|a|r|i|y|a|ü|c|o|l,|p|e|y|a|r|t|t|i|r|i|c|o|l, |v|i|≠|a|i|y|i|y|a|ü|c|o|l, |v|i|≠|a|i|t|t|i|r|i|c|o|l, |i|Ò|a|i|y|i|y|a|ü|c|o|l,|i|Ò|a|i|t|t|i|r|i|c|o|l, |u|r|i|y|i|y|a|ü|c|o|l, |u|r|i|t|t|i|r|i|c|o|l|l|e|≠|a |e|ı|v|a|k|a|i|t|t|‡|m,|t|a|m|i|©|n|‡|Ò|Ò|i|ü|k|u|r|i|y|a |c|o|l|l|e|≠|ü|a|v|‡|ü|u.
