<|P><|B>|v|a-|ü|u.</|B> |v|e|ü|p|u, |v|i|l|a|Ô|k|a|l, |v|i|ı|Ò|u, |a|Ò|u|k|k|a|l, |p|o|ü|ü|a|i, |p|o|r|u|p|p|u, |p|o|ü|a|i,|a|ü|a|i, |n|a|v|i|r|a|m, |k|u|≠|ü|u, |k|u|v|a|Ò|u, |v|a|r|a|i, |c|i|l|a|m|p|u, |ù|Ô|k|a|l |e-|m, |p|a|Ò|i,|p|‡|r, |p|u|Ò|a|v|i, |p|o|©|i|l, |i|Ò|a|m |e-|m, |e|l|l|i, |k|a|Ô|k|u|l, |a|l|k|a|l, |a|l |e-|m,|k|o|Ô|k|a|i, |k|u|r|Â|k|k|a|ı, |k|u|y|a|m, |v|a|l|l|u |e-|m, |c|u|ı|a|Ô|k|u, |t|u|t|t|i, |u|t|t|i,|t|i|t|a|l|a|i, |t|o|y|y|i|l |e-|m, |t|u|y|t|t|a|l, |m|i|c|a|i|t|a|l, |n|u|k|a|r|t|a|l, |a|y|i|ü|a|l |e-|m |i|v|a|i|m|u|ü|a|i|y|õ |p|o|r|u|Î|‡|t|i|y|‡|ü|a|≠|u|Î, |o|r|u|p|o|r|u|Î|k|a|r|u|t|i|y|a |p|a|l|a |p|e|y|a|r|t|t|i|r|i|c|o|l.|c|‡|t|t|a|≠|õ, |v|a|n|t|‡|y|õ; |k|Â|t|t|a|≠|ù, |v|a|n|t|‡|y|ù |e-|m, "|ù|o |v|u|v|a|m|a |≠|u|ü|a|©|v|i|≠|ü|i|y|o|t|t|a|t|õ" (|k|a|Î|a|v|a|©|i. 36), "|k|u|ü|a|v|a|r|u |m|a|r|u|Î|u|Ô |k|u|≠|ü|a|m" (|m|a|l|a|i|p|a|Ò|u.275), |e-|m |v|a|r|u|m|i|v|a|i |v|i|≠|‡ |o|r|u|m|a|i|y|i|≠|u|m |u|y|a|r|v|u |c|i|ü|a|p|p|o|r|u|m|a|i|y|i|≠|u|m|v|a|n|t|a |p|a|l|a|v|i|Ò|a|i|t|t|i|r|i|c|o|l. |u|ü|u, |t|a|v|a, |n|a|≠|i, |k|a|©|i |e|≠|u|m|i|v|a|i|m|i|k|u|t|i|y|o|r|u|m|a|i|y|a|i|t|t|a|©|u|v|i|y|a |p|a|l|a |u|r|i|t|t|i|r|i|c|o|l. |p|i|ü|a|v|u|m|a|≠|≠|a.

<|P>|i|≠|i|p |p|a|l|a|p|o|r|u|Î|k|u|ü|i|t|t|a |o|r|u|p|e|y|a|r|t|t|i|r|i|c|o|l |v|a|r|u|m|‡|ü|u: |u|n|t|i, |ù|Ò|a|i,|n|a|ü|a|v|a|m, |v|‡|r|a|ı|a|m |e|≠|ü|a|ü|ü|o|Ò|a|k|k|a|t|t|a|≠|a. |i|v|a|ü|ü|u|Î, |u|n|t|i|y|e|≠|p|a|t|u|k|o|p|p|Â|©|i|≠|a|i|y|u|m |‡|ü|ü|i|Ò|a|i|k|k|u|ü|a|i|y|i|≠|a|i|y|u|m |t|õ|r|t|t|a|Ò|Ò|i|≠|a|i|y|u|m|y|‡|©|p|p|a|t|t|a|ü|ü|u|Î|a|i|y|i|≠|a|i|y|u|m|u|ı|a|r|t|t|u|m. |ù|Ò|a|i|y|e|≠|p|a|t|u |y|‡|≠|a|i|p|p|a|Ò|Ò|a|t|t|i|≠|a|i|y|u|m|o|r|u|m|a|r|a|t|t|i|≠|a|i|y|u|m |o|r|u|k|o|Ò|i|y|i|≠|a|i|y|u|m |n|„|r|n|i|l|a|i|y|i|≠|a|i|y|u |m|u|ı|a|r|t|t|u|m.|n|a|ü|a|v|a|m|e|≠|p|a|t|u |k|a|Î|Î|i|≠|a|i|y|u|m |o|r|u|k|o|Ò|i|y|i|≠|a|i|y|u |m|u|ı|a|r|t|t|u|m. |v|‡|r|a|ı|a|m|e|≠|p|a|t|u|k|ù|©|i|y|i|≠|a|i|y|u|m, |p|a|≠|ü|i|y|i|≠|a|i|y|u|m, |y|‡|≠|a|i|y|i|≠|a|i|y|u|m, |c|a|Ô|k|i|≠|a|i|y|u|m|u|ı|a|r|t|t|u|m.|t|u|§|c|i|≠|‡|r, |o|t|u|Ô|k|i|≠|‡|r, |m|‡|ı|Ò|a|t|u |e|≠|ü|a|ü|ü|o|Ò|a|k|k|a|t|t|a|≠|a, |p|a|l|a|t|o|©|i|l |k|u|ü|i|t|t|a|o|r|u |t|o|©|i|ü|ü|i|r|i|c|o|l; |i|v|a|ü|ü|u|Î, |t|u|§|c|i|≠|‡|r|e|≠|p|a|t|u |u|ü|a|Ô|k|i|≠|‡|r|e|≠|p|a|t|a|≠|a|i|y|u|m|i|ü|a|n|t|‡|r|e|≠|p|a|t|a|≠|a|i|y|u |m|u|ı|a|r|t|t|u|m. |o|t|u|Ô|k|i|≠|‡|r|e|≠|p|a|t|u|n|a|Ò|a|n|t|‡|r|e|≠|p|a|t|a|≠|a|i|y|u|m |o|Ò|u|Ô|k|i|≠|‡|r|e|≠|p|a|t|a|≠|a|i|y|u|m |u|ı|a|r|t|t|u|m. |m|‡|ı|Ò|a|t|e|≠|p|a|t|u|m|‡|Ò|c|i|m|a|i|p|p|a|Ò|Ò|a |t|e|≠|p|a|t|a|≠|a|i|y|u|m |m|‡|y|n|t|a|t|e|≠|p|a|t|a|≠|a|i|y|u|m |u|ı|a|r|t|t|u|m.|p|i|ü|a|v|u|m|a|≠|≠|a. |t|i|l, |m|a|≠, |m|a|ü|ü|u, |k|o|l |e|≠|ü|a|ü|ü|o|Ò|a|k|k|a|t|t|a|≠|a |p|a|l|a|p|o|r|u|Î|k|a|r|u|t|i|y|a |ù|r|i|Ò|a|i|t|t|i|r|i|c|o|l. |`|k|a|Ò|i|y|e|≠|k|i|Î|a|v|i' |m|u|t|a|l|‡|y|i|≠|a|p|a|l|a|k|u|ı|a|n|t|a|©|u|v|i|y|a |ù|r|u|r|i|t|t|i|r|i|c|o|l. |p|i|ü|a|v|u|m|a|≠|≠|a.

