<|P><|B>|v|a-|ü|u.</|B> |k|a|Ò|a|l|k|a|ı|Ò|‡|≠|e/|ü|‡|l, |a|k|k|‡|Ò|c|i|k|k|u |u|ı|a|r|v|u |m|u|t|a|ü|k|‡|r|a|ı|a|m; |k|a|ı|ı|u|m|o|Î|i|y|u|m|u|t|a|l|‡|≠|a|v|a|i |t|u|ı|a|i|k|k|‡|r|a|ı|a|m; |i|v|a|i |§|‡|p|a|k|a|k |k|a|r|u|v|i.|k|u|©|a|i|c|e|y|t|‡|≠|e|≠|ü|‡|l, |a|t|a|ü|k|u|p |p|o|≠ |m|u|t|a|ü|k|‡|r|a|ı|a|m, |k|a|m|m|a|k |k|a|r|u|v|i|y|u|m|t|„|y|u|m|u|t|a|l|‡|≠|a|v|a|i |t|u|ı|a|i|k|k|‡|r|a|ı|a|m. |i|v|a|i |k|‡|r|a|k|a|k |k|a|r|u|v|i; |p|i|ü|a|v|u|m|a|≠|≠|a.|k|a|r|u|v|i|y|a|i|p |p|o|r|u|ı|m|a|i|p|p|a|≠|m|a|i|y|‡|≠ |m|u|ü|k|Â|ü|i|≠|‡|r|e|≠|k|a. |u|ı|a|r|v|i|≠|‡|l |u|ı|a|r|n|t|‡|≠,|c|u|Ò|a|r|i|≠|‡|ü|k|a|ı|Ò|‡|≠, |p|u|k|a|i|y|u|ı|m|a|i|y|‡|l |e|r|i|y|u|Î|Î|a|t|u, |a|l|a|k|i|≠|‡|l |e|ı|ı|i|≠|‡|≠,|n|‡|©|i|y|‡|l |a|Î|a|n|t|‡|≠; |i|v|a|i |§|‡|p|a|k|a|k |k|a|r|u|v|i. |p|o|≠|≠|‡|l|‡|y|a|m|a|ı|i,|m|a|ı|ı|‡|l|‡|y|a|k|u|Ò|a|m, |v|‡|Î|‡|l|e|ü|i|n|t|‡|≠, |k|a|i|y|‡|l |v|‡|Ô|k|i|≠|‡|≠, |t|a|v|a|t|t|‡|l|v|„|Ò|e|y|t|i|≠|‡|≠, |m|u|y|a|ü|c|i|y|‡|l|‡|y|i|≠|‡|≠, |k|‡|l|‡|l|õ|k|i|≠|‡|≠, |p|o|≠|≠|‡|l|a|ı|i|n|t|‡|≠: |i|v|a|i|k|‡|r|a|k|a|k|k|a|r|u|v|i; "|m|u|t|a|l|v|a|≠|u|m |p|o|r|u|Î|u|Ô |k|a|r|u|m|a|m|u|Ô |k|a|r|u|v|i|y|u|m, |õ|ü|p|a|t|u|n|„|k|k|a|m|u |m|e|≠|a|v|i|v|a|i |k|‡|r|a|k|a|m."
