<|P><|B>((|V|I|R|I)):</|B> |v|a-|ü|u. |t|õ|v|a|r|k|k|u|p|p|Â|c|a|i, |c|‡|t|t|a|ü|k|u|c|c|ù|ü|u, "|i|r|a|p|p|‡|r|k|k|o|≠, |ü|„|v|‡|r|m|õ|≠|i|ü|k|u|m |p|u|k|a|©" (|k|u|ü|a|Î. 232), "|i|r|a|n|t|ù|r|k|k|u|t |t|õ|r|v|„|c|u|m |v|a|ı|k|a|i |y|a|v|a|≠"|e|≠|p|a|≠|a |k|o|Ò|a|i. |m|a|k|k|a|Ò|k|u|p|p|a|k|a|i|v|e|k|u|Î|i, |p|‡|m|p|u|k|k|u|p|p|a|k|a|i |k|„|r|i, "|a|l|l|a|v|a|i|c|e|y|t|‡|r|k |k|a|ü|a|Ô|k|Â|ü|ü|a|m" (|n|‡|≠|m|a|ı|i. 84; |m|Â|t|u|r|a|i, 27; |c|i|l|a|p. 20. |i|ü|u|t|i|v|e|ı|p|‡), "|p|i|ı|i|k|k|u |m|a|r|u|n|t|u |p|i|ü|a|m|a|≠|≠|a|ı|i|y|i|©|a|i, |t|a|≠|≠|ù|y|k|k|u|t |t|‡|≠|õ|m|a|r|u|n|t|u." (|k|u|ü|a|Î. 1102) |e|≠|p|a|≠|a |p|a|k|a|i. |k|a|ü|ü|ù|ü|k|u |m|a|k|a|Î|n|õ|r|n|t|‡|≠,|a|ü|a|t|t|i|ü|k|u|p |p|o|r|u|ı|õ|r|n|t|‡|≠, |i|ü|a|i|k|k|a|t|u|n|õ|r|i|≠ |n|i|≠|a|k|k|i|t|u |n|õ|r|u|m|e|≠|p|a|≠|a|n|õ|r|c|c|i. |a|ü|a|t|t|i|ü|k|u|t|t|a|k|k|a|t|u |a|r|u|Î, |c|‡|t|t|a|ü|k|u|t|t|a|k|k|‡|Î |k|o|ü|ü|i, "|c|e|l|v|a|r|k|k|õ|c|e|l|v|a|n |t|a|k|a|i|t|t|u" (|k|u|ü|a|Î. 125), "|a|r|u|Ô|k|a|l|a |m|u|l|a|k|i|≠ |m|i|k|k|a |v|a|r|a|c|a|r|k|k|õ|y|u|r|i|y|a" (|c|Â|Î|‡. |k|a|l|y|‡|ı|a. 189) |e|≠|p|a|≠|a |t|a|k|u|t|i; |‡|Ò|a|i|k|k|u|n|Â|l,|‡|©|i|k|k|u|p|p|o|≠ |e|≠|p|a|≠|a |a|t|u|v|‡|t|a|l "|v|a|r|i|c|a|i|k|k|u|v|a|r|u|n|t|u|m" (|p|u|ü|a|n|‡. 47),|k|Â|©|u|k|k|u|k|k|u|ü|ü|õ|v|a|l|c|e|y|y|u|m|e|≠|p|a|≠|a |p|o|r|u|Ò|Ò|u; |c|‡|t|t|a|ü|k|u|m|a|k|a|≠,|k|o|ü|ü|a|ü|k|u|m|a|k|a|Î |e|≠|p|a|≠|a |m|u|ü|a|i.
|`|‡|t|i' |e|≠|ü|a|t|a|≠|‡|l, |k|a|r|u|m|p|i|ü|k|u|v|õ|l|i, |m|a|y|i|r|u|k|k|e|ı|ı|e|y, |u|y|i|r|u|k|k|u|ı|Ò|i|y|e|≠|≠|u|m|a|t|a|ü|k|u|v|i|≠|a|i|y|u|Ò|a|i|m|a|i|y|u|m, |c|‡|t|t|a|ü|k|u|p |p|o|r|u|Î|e|≠|≠|u|m |p|a|Ò|u|p|o|r|u|Î|u|m,|k|a|i|k|k|u|y|‡|p|p|u|Ò|a|i|y|a|t|u |k|a|Ò|a|k|a|m|e|≠|≠|u|m |y|‡|p|p|u|Ò|a|i|m|a|i|y|u|m, |n|‡|y|k|k|u |n|a|Ò|p|u|Ò|a|i|y|a|≠|e|≠|≠|u|m |n|a|Ò|p|u|Ò|a|i|m|a|i|y|u|m, |t|‡|y|k|k|u|k |k|‡|t|a|l|a|≠|e|≠|≠|u|m |k|‡|t|a|l|u|m,|v|a|Ò|u|k|a|r|a|c|a|r|k|k|u|c |c|i|ü|a|n|t|ù|r |c|ù|©|i|y|a|v|a|r|a|c|a|r|e|≠|≠|u|m |c|i|ü|a|p|p|u|Ò|a|i|m|a|i|y|u|m|k|o|Î|k|a.
|i|≠|≠|u|m |i|´|t|u, |õ|≠|a|i|v|õ|ü|ü|u|m|a|i|k|a|Î|p|ù|l|a |a|Î|a|v|u|p|a|Ò|Ò|a|p|o|r|u|ı|m|a|i|t|t|a|≠|ü|i|v|a|r|u|m;|a|v|a|i|y|u|m |i|t|a|ü|k|i|´|t|e|≠|p|a|t|õ|p|a|Ò|a |u|r|a|i|t|t|u|k|k|o|Î|k|a. |a|v|a|i |a|r|a|c|a|r|k|k|u|a|m|a|i|c|c|a|≠, |a|v|a|r|k|k|u|t|t|a|m|a|r, |n|a|m|a|k|k|u |n|a|l|l|a|≠, "|n|i|l|a|t|t|u|k |k|a|ı|i|y|e|≠|p|a|n|e|l|l|u|Ô |k|a|r|u|m|p|u|m" (|n|‡|≠|m|a|ı|i. 9), "|m|a|≠|a|i|k|k|u|p|p|‡|© |v|‡|ı|u|t|a|l|i|≠|m|a|i"(|n|‡|≠|m|a|ı|i. 20), "|p|ù|r|k|k|u|p|p|u|ı|a|i|m|a|≠" (|p|u. |v|e. 4: 20), "|k|a|Î|v|‡|r|k|k|u|t|t|a|Î|Î|u |m|u|y|i|r|n|i|l|a|i" (|k|u|ü|a|Î. 290), "|a|n|t|a|ı|a|r |n|Â|ü|k|u |m|a|ü|a|t|t|i|ü|k|u|m|‡|t|i|y|‡|y" (|k|u|ü|a|Î. 543), "|u|ı|Ò|i |v|e|y|y|ù|r|k |k|u|ü|u|p|i|ı|i |y|e|Î|i|t|u" (|m|u|t|u|m|o|©|i.77), "|p|a|l|l|u|k|k|u|t |t|ù|ü|ü|a |p|a|≠|i|m|u|l|l|a|i" |y|‡. |v|i. 4. |m|õ|ü.), "|Â|r|k|k|u|m|a|ı|i|t|t|õ |p|o|y|k|a|i |p|o|y|k|a|i|k|k|u|c, |c|õ|y|t|t|u |m|a|≠|ü|õ |c|i|ü|u|k|‡|≠|y|‡|ü|õ" (|k|u|ü|u|n.113), "|t|a|≠|a|k|k|u|c|c|a|r|i|y|e|≠|p|a |n|a|l|l|‡|Ò|‡|≠|a|v|a|ü|k|„|≠|ü|a |m|a|i|n|t|a|≠", "|m|a|i|n|t|a|ü|k|u|m|a|Ò|a|v|‡|Ò|k|u |n|i|k|a|©|n|t|a|k|õ|Ò |Ò|a|§|c|u|m|i|≠ |k|o|l|a|i|y|a|§|c|u|m|i|≠|ü|„|y|a|≠|a" |e|≠|p|a|≠|a|m|u|t|a|l|‡|y|i|≠|a|v|e|≠|a|k|k|o|Î|k|a.
