"|v|e|n|t|u|p|p|i|≠|a|≠ |v|i|ü|a|l|v|a|©|u|t|i |y|o|Ò|u", "|a|§|c|‡|y|a|l|a |Î|‡|y|i|©|a|i|m|u|≠","|k|a|Ò|a|ü|ü|‡|≠|a|i|y|a|r |k|a|©|a|l|v|õ|n|t|a|r|a|i", "|p|e|r|u|v|a|r|a|i |m|i|c|a|i|y|a|t|u|n|e|Ò|u|v|e|Î|Î|a|r|u|v|i" (|k|u|ü|u|n. 78) "|p|u|≠|ü|‡ |Î|ù|m|a|i|y|a |c|u|r|a|≠|i|ü|a|n |t|ù|r|õ" (|k|u|ü|u|n.260) |e-|m, "|p|e|r|u|v|õ|Ò|k|a|i|y|a |≠|e|ü|p|i|r|i|n|t|u", "|k|a|ı|p|u|r|a|i |k|‡|t|a|l|õ |m|e|m|m|u|m|u|Î|Î|‡|≠" |e-|m, "|u|l|a|Ô|k|o |Ò|ù|Î|i|≠|a|i |y|o|r|u|n|i|≠|≠|‡|l", "|v|i|≠|a|i|v|õ|Ò|k|a|i|y|i|r |v|„|r|a|r|v|a|m|m|i|≠" |e-|m |v|i|≠|a|i|k|k|u|ü|i|p|p|u |m|u|ü|ü|u|k|k|a|Î |a|i|m|p|‡|≠ |m|Â|v|i|Ò|a|t|t|u|m|p|e|y|a|r|e|c|c|a|v|i|≠|a|i|k|k|u|ü|i|p|p|‡|y|i|≠|a. |i|v|a|i |i|v|v|‡|ü|u |p|e|y|a|r |p|a|Ò|‡|t|a|≠|a|v|e|≠|a|k|k|o|Î|k|a.
|a|´|t|õ|l, |m|u|ü|ü|u |e|c|c|a|m|‡|m|e|≠|ü|a|t|u |e|≠|≠|a|i? |e|c|c|a|n|t|‡|≠|õ |p|‡|l|u|m |t|i|ı|a|i|y|u|m |i|Ò|a|m|u|m|v|i|Î|a|k|k|i|ü |ü|e|≠|≠|a |a|m|a|i|y|‡|t|ù|v|e|≠|i|≠, |e|c|c|a|m|‡|k|a |v|ù|t|i|y|a |v|‡|y|p|‡|Ò|Ò|u|m|o|©|i|k|a|Î|v|a|©|a|k|k|i|Ò|a|t|t|u|m |c|e|y|y|u|Î|i|Ò|a|t|t|u|m |p|‡|l|u|m |t|i|ı|a|i|y|u|m |i|Ò|a|m|u|m |v|i|Î|a|k|k|‡|t|u|p|o|t|u|v|‡|y|n|i|ü|ü|a|l|‡|≠|u|m, |i|v|a|ü|ü|u|Ò |c|i|l|a |v|i|≠|a|i|y|e|c|c|a|n|t|a|≠|≠|a|i|y|õ|ü|ü|u |n|i|ü|p|a|≠|a|v|u|m|u|Î|a|v|‡|k|a|l|‡|≠|u|m |a|m|a|i|y|‡|t|e|≠|k|a.
