<|P>|i|≠|i|p |p|i|ü|a|t|o|©|i|l |k|o|ı|Ò|a|≠|a |v|a|r|u|m|‡|ü|u: "|v|i|ı|ı|i|ü |ü|Â|v|i|y|i|Ò|Ò|‡|≠|v|a|n|t|u|v|„|©|n|t|a|≠|a" (|c|„|v|a|k|a. 894), "|k|a|l|a|i|t|t|o|©|i|l |p|a|Ò|a|v|e|©|„|i|p |p|‡|Ò|i|≠|‡|Î|k|a|≠|i|n,|t|i|l|a|i|p|p|o|©|i|l |k|u|r|a|Ô|k|i|≠|a |v|„|≠|ü|a |t|Â|ı|Ò|a|Î|i|r" (|c|„|v|a|k|a. 657), "|p|‡|y|u|m|‡|r|i|p|ù|ü |p|a|k|a|©|i |c|i|n|t|i|≠|‡ |r|‡|y|a|r |m|a|t|t|e|ü|i |t|a|y|i|r|i |≠|‡|y|i|≠|‡|r" (|c|„|v|a|k|a.421), "|k|‡|≠|a|v|a |r|i|r|i|y|a |v|i|l|v|‡|y|k |k|a|Ò|u|Ô|k|a|ı|a|i |t|o|Ò|u|t|t|a |l|ù|Ò|u, |m|‡|≠|i|r|a|i|p|e|y|a|r|n|t|a |t|‡|y|a |r|‡|r|t|t|a|≠|a |r|a|ı|i|n|t|a |t|i|ı|Ò|ù|Î, |t|‡|≠|o|≠|ü|u |m|u|Ò|a|Ô|k|i|ü |ü|o|≠|ü|u|n|i|m|i|r|n|t|a|t|u |c|a|r|a|m|p|e|y |m|‡|r|i, |p|ù|≠|i|≠|ü|a |t|e|≠|p|a |m|a|ü|ü|a|p |p|o|r|u|v|a|r|u|§ |c|i|l|a|i|y|i|≠|‡|ü|k|õ" (|c|„|v|a|k|a. 452), "|c|e|y|y|ù|≠ |c|e|©|u|m|p|o|ü |c|a|r|a|§|c|e|≠|ü|a|≠|a |c|e|≠|ü|a |t|‡|v|i"(|c|„|v|a|k|a. 2322) |e|≠|a|k|k|‡|ı|k|a. |p|i|ü|a|v|u|m|a|≠|≠|a.

