<|P><|B>((|W|F|W)):</|B> |i|r|u|t|i|ı|a|i|y|i|Ò|a|t|t|u|m |‡|ı|m|a|i|p|p|o|r|u|Î|i|≠|u|m |p|e|ı|m|a|i|p |p|o|r|u|Î|i|≠|u|m|o|≠|ü|a|≠|a|i|y|o|©|i|k|k|u|m, |a|v|v|i|r|u|p|‡|ü|k|u|m |p|o|t|u|v|‡|≠|a |p|e|y|a|r|c|c|o|l|l|u|m |v|i|≠|a|i|c|c|o|l|l|u|m|k|u|ü|i|p|p|i|≠|‡|≠ |e-|ü|u.

<|P><|B>((|V|I|R|I)):</|B> |v|a-|ü|u. |v|a|Ò|u|k|a|r|a|c|a|r |‡|y|i|r|a|v|a|r |m|a|k|k|a|Î|a|i|y|u|Ò|a|i|y|‡|r,"|m|a|m|m|a|r|k|o|ı |m|‡|n|t|a|r|k |k|a|ı|a|Ô|k|‡|k|u|n |t|a|≠|k|a|i|k|k|ù|l, |a|m|m|a|≠|a|i|k|k|ù |l|‡|k|i|y|a|§|‡|≠|ü|u" (|n|‡|l|a|Ò|i. 14) |e-|m, |p|e|r|u|n|t|õ|v|i |p|o|ü|a|i|y|u|y|i|r|t|t|a |k|a|Ò|Ò|i|ü|k|„|© |n|‡|l|v|a|r|m|a|k|k|a|Î|u|Î|a|r, |i|t|u, |p|a|t|t|u |m|‡|≠|i|Ò|a|t|t|i|≠ |m|u|l|a|i|p|p|‡|l |e-|m|u|y|a|r|t|i|ı|a|i|p|p|e|ı|ı|o|©|i|p|e|y|a|r|u|m |‡|ı|o|©|i|p|e|y|a|r|u|m |v|a|n|t|a|v|‡|ü|u. |a|r|a|c|a|r|‡|y|i|r|a|v|a|r|m|a|k|k|a|Î|o|Ò|u |t|‡|v|a|Ò|i|p|ù|y|i|≠|‡|r, |i|≠|ü|u |i|c|c|õ|r|i|y|‡|r|u|m |a|c|c|õ|r|i|y|‡|r|u|m|p|o|r|u|p|a |e-|m, |i|≠|ü|u |i|v|v|Â|r|‡|r|e|l|l|‡|m |t|a|i|n|n|„|r|‡|Ò|u|p|a, |k|u|ü|u|Ô|k|‡|≠|a|m|p|ù|p|a |e-|m|u|y|a|r|t|i|ı|a|i|p|p|e|ı|ı|o|©|i |v|i|≠|a|i|y|u|m |‡|ı|o|©|i |v|i|≠|a|i|y|u|m |v|a|n|t|a|v|‡|ü|u. |n|a|m|m|a|r|a|c|a|≠|‡|y|i|r|a|m|y|‡|≠|a|i|y|u|Ò|a|i|y|a|≠ |e-|m, |n|a|m|p|i |n|Â|ü|u |e|r|u|m|a|i|y|u|Ò|a|i|y|a|≠ |e-|m|a|´|ü|i|ı|a|i|p|p|e|ı|ı|o|©|i|p|e|y|a|r|u|m |‡|ı|o|©|i|p|e|y|a|r|u|m |v|a|n|t|a|v|‡|ü|u. |i|≠|ü|u|i|v|v|Â|r|p|p|e|ü|ü|a|m|e|l|l|‡|m |u|©|a|v|o|©|i|n|t|a|≠|a |e-|m, |i|≠|ü|u |i|v|v|Â|r|p|p|e|ü|ü|a |m|e|l|l|‡|m|a|ü|a|t|t|i|ü|t|õ|k|a|ü|a|k|k|u|m |e-|m |a|´|ü|i|ı|a|i|p |p|e|ı|ı|o|©|i |v|i|≠|a|i|y|u|m |‡|ı|o|©|i |v|i|≠|a|i|y|u|m|v|a|n|t|a|v|‡|ü|u.

