<|P><|B>((|V|I|R|I)):</|B> |v|a-|ü|u. |‡|v|‡|r|‡|t|u, |m|a|r|a|t|t|a|i|k|k|u|ü|a|i|y|‡|≠,|c|‡|t|t|a|≠|o|Ò|u|c|õ|r|‡|≠, |t|õ|v|a|r|k|k|u|c|c|i|ü|a|p|p|e|Ò|‡|≠, |m|a|l|a|i|y|i|≠ |i|©|i|y|‡|≠, |c|‡|t|t|a|≠|a|t|u|a|≠|ü|u, |Â|r|k|k|a|ı|i|r|‡|≠, |c|‡|t|t|‡|c|‡|y|a|l (|c|‡|y|‡|t|õ) |e|≠|a |e|Ò|Ò|u |v|õ|ü|ü|u|m|a|i|y|u|r|u|p|u|m|t|i|r|i|y|‡|t|u|v|a|n|t|a|≠|a. |u|ı|ı|‡|≠|c|‡|t|t|a|≠, (|k|o|Ò|‡|≠, |k|o|Ò|‡|Î, |k|o|Ò|‡|r, |k|o|Ò|‡|t|u, |k|o|Ò|‡,|k|o|Ò|õ|≠, |k|o|Ò|õ|m, |k|o|Ò|u|k|k|i|l|a|i, |k|o|Ò|u|k|k|i|l|„|r) + (|c|‡|t|t|a|ü|k|u) |e|≠|a |m|u|ü|ü|u|v|i|≠|a|i|t|i|r|i|y|‡|t|u|v|a|n|t|a|≠|a. (|u|ı|ı|‡|t|a, |t|i|≠|≠|‡|t|a) + (|a|v|a|≠, |a|v|a|Î, |a|v|a|r, |a|t|u,|a|v|a|i, |y|‡|≠, |y|‡|m, |n|„, |n|„|y|i|r) |e|≠|a|p |p|e|y|a|r|e|c|c|a|m |t|i|r|i|y|‡|t|u |v|a|n|t|a|≠|a.
