<|P><|B>((|V|I|R|I)):</|B> |`|v|i|≠|a|i|v|õ|ü|a|Ò|u|k|k|i|≠|u|m' |e|≠|a|v|õ |u|r|u|p|u|k|a|Î |t|a|m|m|u|Î |m|a|y|a|Ô|k|i|y|u|m|a|Ò|u|k|k|u|m|e|≠|k|a.

<|P><|B>|v|a-|ü|u.</|B> "|k|a|Ò|k|i|≠|i|y|‡|Î |k|‡|t|a|l|a|≠ |k|‡|t|a|l |v|a|k|a|i|p|u|≠|a|i|v|‡|Î, |u|Ò|k|u|Ò|a|i|y|‡|Î|Â|r|‡|ı|i|y|a|l|p|i|≠|‡|Î - |u|Ò|k|i, |i|Ò|a|≠|a|ü|i|n |t|Â|Ò|i |y|i|≠|i|t|i |≠|u|ı|a|r|u, |m|a|Ò|a|m|o|©|i |m|‡|t|a|r|‡|Î|p|e|ı" (|n|‡|l|a|Ò|i. 384), "|k|‡|l|‡|r |k|a|©|a|l|‡|r |k|a|Ò|u|§|c|i|l|a|i|y|‡|r |k|a|i|k|k|o|ı|Ò|a, |v|õ|l|‡|r|v|e|r|u|v|a|n|t|a |t|ù|ü|ü|a|t|t|‡|r - |k|‡|l|a|≠, |k|i|Î|a|r|n|t|‡|l|u|m |p|ù|l|v|‡|r |k|i|ı|a|i|p|p|Â|c|a|l|k|õ|Ò|Ò|õ, |u|Î|a|r|n|t|‡|r |n|i|r|a|i|p|p|e|y|a|r|v|u |m|u|ı|Ò|u" (|p|u. |v|e. 2:2) |e|≠|a |i|v|a|i |ù|r|u|r|u|p|u |a|Ò|u|k|k|i|t |t|a|m|a|k|k|õ|ü|ü|a |o|r|u|p|e|y|a|r|u|m |o|r|u|v|i|≠|a|i|y|u|m |i|ü|u|t|i|v|a|r|a|m|u|Ò|i|n|t|a|≠|a. |y|‡|≠|a|i|y|a|t|u |k|ù|Ò|Ò|a|i |n|u|≠|i|k|k|a|Ò|p|o|r|u|Ò|k|u |v|‡|Î|‡|ü |k|u|ü|a|i|t|t|‡|≠|e|≠|a|i|t|u |p|a|l|a|v|u|m |m|a|y|a|Ô|k|i|y|a|Ò|u|k|k|i |i|ü|u|t|i |o|r|u|v|i|≠|a|i|k|o|ı|Ò|u |m|u|Ò|i|n|t|a|t|u.|p|i|ü|a|v|u|m|a|≠|≠|a.
(|u|ı|Ò|‡|≠ |t|i|≠|ü|‡|≠ |ù|Ò|i|≠|‡|≠ |p|‡|Ò|i|≠|‡|≠) + (|c|‡|t|t|a|≠), "|v|a|r|u|t|i |p|e|y|a|r|t|i|v|a|r|u|n|t|u|t|i |t|u|§|c|‡|y, |p|o|r|u|t|i |p|u|l|a|m|p|u|t|i |n|„|y|u|Ô-|k|a|r|u|t|u|Ô|k|‡|ü, |p|a|ı|Ò|i|≠|a|i|y|a|l|l|a|i|y|‡|ü |p|‡|©|i|t|t|ù|Ò |k|ù|t|a|i|y|a|i|k, |k|a|ı|Ò|a|≠|a|i|y|ù |v|‡|©|i |k|a|Ò|a|l" |e-|m,"|i|Î|a|i|y|a|ı |m|e|l|l|i|y|a|ı |m|a|Ò|a|n|t|a|i, |a|r|i|y|a |c|õ|y|a |p|e|r|u|Ô|k|‡|≠ |y|‡|ü|õ"("|e|m|m|Â|r|a|l|l|a|t|u" |e|≠|≠|u|m |c|e|y|y|u|Î) |e-|m |v|i|≠|a|i |v|i|≠|a|i|k|k|u|ü|i|p|p|u|m|u|ü|ü|u|v|i|r|a|v|‡|t|u |a|Ò|u|k|k|i |o|r|u |p|e|y|a|r|o|Ò|u|m|u|Ò|i|n|t|a|≠|a. "|n|e|l|l|a|r|i|y|u |m|i|r|u|n|t|o|©|u|v|a|r,|c|e|§|§|‡|y|i|ü|ü|u |v|e|y|i|≠|m|u|≠|a|i|y|i|ü, |ü|e|ı|k|a|Ò|a|ü|ü|i|r|a|i |m|i|c|a|i|p|p|‡|y|u|n|t|u, |t|i|ı|Ò|i|m|i|l|v|a|≠|p|a|r|a|t|a|v|a|r, |v|e|p|p|u|Ò|a|i|y|a |m|a|Ò|Ò|u|ı|Ò|u, |t|a|ı|k|u|r|a|v|a|i|c |c|„|r|t|Â|Ô|k|u|n|t|u, |t|Â|v|a|ü|k|a|l|i|t|t|a |t|õ|m|p|‡|y |p|u|≠|≠|a|i, |m|e|l|l|i|ı|a|r|k|k|a|ı|ı|i |m|i|l|a|i|n|t|a |m|a|i|n|t|a|r, |e|l|v|a|Î|a|i|m|a|k|a|Î|i|r |t|a|l|a|i|k|k|a|i |t|a|r|Â|u|n|t|u, |v|a|ı|Ò|u|p|a|Ò|a |m|a|l|a|r|n|t|a |t|a|ı|ı|a|ü|u|Ô |k|‡|≠|a|l,|m|u|ı|Ò|a|k|a|k |k|ù|t|a|i |y|o|ı|Ò|o|Ò|i |m|a|k|a|Î|i|r, |i|r|u|m|p|a|≠|a|i|y|i|≠ |k|u|r|u|m|p|a|i|n|„|r|u|m,|p|Â|Ô|k|a|r|u|m|p|i|≠ |ü|„|§|c|‡|ü|u|m, |ù|Ô|k|u|m|a|ı|a|ü |k|u|v|a|v|u|t|t|‡|©|a|i|t, |t|„|n|„|r|ù |Ò|u|Ò|a|≠|v|i|r|‡|y,|m|u|n|n|„|r|u|ı|Ò|u |m|u|n|n|„|r|p |p|‡|y|u|m, |t|‡|Ô|k|‡ |v|i|Î|a|i|y|u |ı|a|l|l|Â|r |k|e|©|„|i|y|a", (|p|u|ü|a|n|‡.24) |e-|m, "|c|i|ü|i|y|a |p|e|r|i|y|a |n|i|k|a|r|m|a|l|a|r|k |k|ù|t|a|i|t|a|≠",  (|c|„|ü|a|Ò|i|p|p|õ|r|a|k|a|l)|e-|m |p|e|y|a|r|e|c|c|a|v|i|≠|a|i|y|u|m |k|u|ü|i|p|p|u|m |a|Ò|u|k|k|i|v|a|n|t|u |o|r|u|p|e|y|a|r|k|o|ı|Ò|a|≠|a."|c|o|l|l|a|r|u|§ |c|Â|ü|p|a|c|u|m |p|‡|m|p|i|≠ |ü|ù|ü|ü|a|m|p|ù|l, |m|e|l|l|a|v|õ |k|a|r|u|v|i|r|u|n |t|„|≠|ü|u|m|õ|l|a|l|‡|r, |c|e|l|v|a|m|õ |p|ù|ü|ü|a|l|a|i |n|i|ü|u|v|i|t |t|õ|r|n|t|a|n|Â|ü, |k|a|l|v|i|c|õ|r |m|‡|n|t|a|r|i|≠|i|ü|a|i|§|c|i|k |k|‡|y|t|t|a|v|õ" (|c|„|v|a|k|a. 53), "|n|‡|Î|a|≠|ü|u |p|ù|k|i|p |p|u|Î|Î|i|Ò|a|i|t|a|Ò|p|a|p,|p|a|t|a|≠|a|≠|ü|u |p|u|k|k|u|t |t|i|ü|a|≠|a|≠|ü|u |m|o|©|i|y|i|≠|u|m, |v|a|ü|i|t|u |p|e|y|a|r |k|u|v|a |r|a|l|l|a|r"(|p|u|ü|a|n|‡. 124) |e-|m |v|i|≠|a|i|y|e|c|c|a|v|i|≠|a|i|y|u|m |k|u|ü|i|p|p|u|m|a|Ò|u|k|k|i |o|r|u|v|i|≠|a|i|k|o|ı|Ò|a|≠|a. "|e|≠|a|i|t|t|u|m|u|ü |ü|a|Ò|u|k|k|i|≠|u |m|a|≠|a|i|t|t|u|m|o|r|u |p|e|y|a|r|m|õ|l,|n|i|≠|a|i|t|t|u|k|k|o|Î|a |n|i|k|a|©|u |n|i|k|a|©|t|t|i|y|a |m|u|ü|ü|õ, |v|i|≠|a|i|y|e|§|c|u |k|i|Î|a|v|i|y|u|m|p|e|y|a|r|e|§|c|u |k|i|Î|a|v|i|y|u|m, |p|a|l|a|p|a|l|a |v|a|Ò|u|k|k|i|≠|u |m|u|ü|ü|u |m|o|©|i|p|p|a|Ò|i|y|a" |e|≠|p|a|t|u|a|k|a|t|t|i|y|a|m.

<|P><|B>|{|{|p|i-|m|}|}</|B> |i|ü|u|t|i|y|i|l|õ|v|a|r|i|≠ |a|t|a|≠|ù|Ò|‡|t|i|y|i|≠|a|Ò|u|k|k|i|≠|a|v|u|r|u|p|u|k|a|Î|u|m|v|i|≠|a|i|k|a|Î|u|n |t|a|m|a|k|k|u |õ|ü|ü|a|p|e|y|a|r|u|m |v|i|≠|a|i|y|u|m|k|o|ı|Ò|u |m|u|Ò|i|v|a|≠|a|v|‡|m|e|≠|ü|a|v|‡|ü|u(1) |Î|Â|r|k|‡|ı|i|y|a|l|p|u, (2) |Î|Â|r|n|‡|ı|i|y|a|l|p|u |v|e|r|u|v|a|r|u|t|ù|ü|ü|a|t|t|‡|r |i|v|a|i |m|‡|t|a|r|‡|Î|p|e|ı|ı|e|≠|ü|u|m, |v|e|r|u|v|a|r|u|t|ù|ü|ü|a|t|t|‡|r |u|Î|a|r|n|t|‡|r|e|≠|ü|u|m|e|©|u|v|‡|y|u|r|u|p|u|p|a|l|a|v|a|Ò|u|k|k|i|t |k|i|ı|a|i|p|p|Â|c|a|l - |p|a|ü|a|i|m|u|©|a|k|k|a|m. |y|‡|≠|a|i|y|a|t|u|p|a|l|a|m|a|y|a|Ô|k|i (1)|p|a|ı|Ò|a|i|y|a|i, (2) |p|a|ı|Ò|i|≠|≠|a|i |e-|m |p|a|Ò|a|r|k|k|a|i |v|i|≠|a|i|m|u|ü|ü|u|m|m|u|≠|≠|i|l|a|i |v|i|≠|a|i|m|u|ü|ü|u|m |v|i|≠|a|i|k|k|u|ü|i|p|p|u |m|u|ü|ü|u|m |v|i|r|a|v|‡|t|a|Ò|u|k|k|i, |`|c|‡|t|t|a|≠,|k|a|Ò|a|l, |m|a|Ò|a|n|t|a|i' |e|≠|a|t |t|a|m|a|k|k|õ|ü|ü|a |p|e|y|a|r|k|o|ı|Ò|u |m|u|Ò|i|n|t|a|≠|a. |e-|m|`|p|‡|y|u|n|t|u...|p|‡|y|u|n|t|u' |c|e|y|y|u|m|e|≠|ü|a |p|e|y|a|r|e|c|c|a|m|v|i|Î|a|i|y|u|Î|e|≠|ü|a|p|e|y|a|r|k|o|ı|Ò|u|m, |c|i|ü|i|y|a |p|e|r|i|y|a |e|≠|ü|a |p|e|y|a|r|e|c|c|a|v|i|≠|a|i|k|k|u|ü|i|p|p|u |p|ù|k|u|v|a|r|a|l|l|a|r |e-|m |`|m|e|l|l|a|v|õ|k|a|r|u|v|i|r|u|n|t|u' |e|≠|≠|u|m|c|e|y|t|e|≠|ü|a |v|i|≠|a|i|y|e|c|c|a|m|u|m, |n|‡|Î|a|≠|ü|e|≠|ü|a |n|‡|Î|a|≠|ü|i |e|≠|ü|a|v|i|≠|a|i|y|e|c|c|a|k|k|u|ü|i|p|p|u|m |a|Ò|u|k|k|i|v|a|n|t|u |o|r|u|v|i|≠|a|i|k|o|ı|Ò|a|≠|a. |v|i|≠|a|i|y|‡|v|a|t|u|`|k|‡|y|t|t|a' |e|≠|ü|a|t|u|m |`|p|ù|k|u|v|a|r|a|l|l|a|r' |e|≠|ü|a|t|u|m|‡|m. |c|o|l - |n|e|l. |t|a|Ò|p|a -|t|a|Ò|u|p|p|a. "|õ|≠|a|i |m|u|ü|ü|a|Ò|u|k|k|i|≠|u|m... |m|o|©|i|p|p|a|Ò|i|y|õ" |e|≠|p|a|t|u |a|k|a|t|t|i|y|a|m


