<|A |N|A|M|E="|_|N|A|m|a|_355"><|H4>355</|H4></|A>
<|P>	|u|r|u|p|u |m|u|ü|ü|„ |r|e|c|c|a|Ô |k|o|Î|Î|u|m
<|B|R>	|p|e|y|a|r|v|i|≠|a|i |y|i|Ò|a|i|p|p|i|ü|a |v|a|r|a|l|u|m|‡ |m|õ|ü|p|a|≠|a.

|i|t|u|v|u|m|a|t|u.

<|P><|B>((|W|F|W)):</|B> |u|r|u|p|u|k|a|Î|u|m |m|u|ü|ü|u|v|i|≠|a|i|k|a|Î|u|m |p|e|y|a|r|e|c|c|a|v|i|≠|a|i|y|e|c|c|a|Ô|k|a|Î|u|m |t|‡|m|t|‡|m|k|o|Î|Î|u|m |p|e|y|a|r|k|k|u|m |v|i|≠|a|i|k|k|u|m |n|a|Ò|u|v|õ |‡|ı|Ò|a|i|k|k|u |õ|ü|p|a|≠|a|v|‡|≠|a|p|i|ü|a|c|o|ü|k|a|Î |v|a|r|a|v|u|m|p|e|ü|u|m |e-|ü|u.

<|P><|B>((|V|I|R|I)):</|B> |u|m|m|a|i|y|‡|≠ |v|a|r|a|p|p|e|ü|u|t|a|l |o|r|u|t|a|l|a|i|y|a|l|l|a|v|e|≠|k|a.

<|P><|B>|v|a-|ü|u.</|B> |c|‡|t|t|a|≠ |p|a|k|a|l |v|a|y|i|ü|‡|r|a|v|u|ı|Ò|‡|≠, |a|ü|a|t|t|a|i |a|©|a|k|u |p|e|r|u|k|a|c |c|e|y|t|‡|≠,|v|‡|Î|‡|≠|õ |m|a|r|u|v|‡|r|a|i |m|‡|y|a |v|e|Ò|Ò|i|≠|‡|≠, |t|õ|v|a|r|k|k|u|c |c|e|l|v|a|m |v|õ|ı|Ò|i|c|c|i|ü|a|p|p|e|Ò|u|t|t|‡|≠, |m|a|l|a|i|y|i|≠|i|≠|ü|u |u|r|u|ı|Ò|u |v|„|©|n|t|‡|≠, |c|‡|t|t|a|≠|a|t|u|i|Ò|a|t|t|a|Ò|a|k|k|a|i|y|‡|≠|a|i, |Â|r|k|k|a|ı|u|y|a|r|n|t|a |v|o|Î|i|m|‡|Ò|a|m, |c|‡|t|t|‡ |k|Â|t|t|a|ü|k|u|k|k|Â|ü|a|i|k|o|Ò|u |e-|m, "|p|‡|Ò|i|≠|‡|≠ |ü|õ|v|a|k|„|t|a|m |p|a|ı|ı|i|≠|u|k |k|a|r|a|c|a|≠" (|c|„|v|a|k|a.2052), "|a|©|u|t|‡ |Ò|a|Ò|a|m|‡|k|a |v|a|ı|a|Ô|k|i|©|a|i|y|õ" (|c|„|v|a|k|a. 1523) |e-|m,"|k|o|≠|ü|u|r|u|t|t|a |k|Â|r|v|õ|l|a|v|a|r|k |k|u|ü|u|k|i", "|o|Ò|Ò|‡|r, |c|e|v|i|p|u|t|a|i|k|k|u|n |t|„|y|a|k|a|Ò|u|§|c|o|ü |k|a|v|i|y|u|Ò|a|i|t|t|‡|y" (|`|p|a|l|y|‡|≠|a|i |m|a|≠|≠|a|r' |u|Î|a|m|e|l|i|m|a|k|a|Î|i|r|i|≠|o|Ò|u|Ô|k|u |m|e|≠|p|a|≠|a|v|õ" (|c|„|v|a|k|a. 49), "|m|u|r|i|n|t|u|p|ù |t|a|v|i|©|n|t|u|k|o|Ô|k|u|y|i|r|k|k|u |m|u|l|l|a|i|y|i|≠" (|c|„|v|a|k|a. 48) |e-|m, |m|u|ü|a|i|y|õ |õ|ü|p|a|≠|a |i|Ò|a|i|v|a|n|t|a|≠|a."|u|p|p|i|≠|ü|u, |p|u|ü|k|a|i |y|u|ı|k|a|m|‡ |k|o|ü|k|a|i |y|ù|≠|õ" |e|≠|a |v|i|≠|a|i|y|e|c|c|a|k |k|u|ü|i|p|p|i|≠|u|m|i|Ò|a|i|v|a|n|t|a|t|u. |p|i|ü|a|v|u |m|a|≠|≠|a.
|`|õ|ü|p|a|≠|a' |e|≠|a|v|õ |õ|l|‡|t|a|≠|a |v|a|r|a|p|p|e|ü|‡|v|e|≠|p|a|t|‡|m. |a|v|a|i |v|a|l|l|a |m|e|ü|i|n|t|a|n|a|l|l|i|Î|a|Ô|k|ù|c|a|r|t|a|n|t|a|i |m|a|l|l|a|l|y|‡|≠|a|i|p |p|e|r|u|v|a|©|u|t|i |e|≠|p|a|t|a|≠|u|Î,|v|a|l|l|a|m|e|ü|i|t|a|l |p|e|r|u|v|a|©|u|t|i|m|õ|ü|ü|õ|y|e|≠|i|≠, |n|a|l|l|i|Î|a|Ô|k|ù|c|a|r|t|a|n|t|a|i|y|e|≠|p|a|t|a|≠|a|i|i|Ò|a|i|n|i|ü|u|v|i|≠, |õ|l|‡|t|‡|m; |v|a|l|l|a|m|e|ü|i|n|t|a |m|a|l|l|a|l|y|‡|≠|a|i|p |p|e|r|u|v|a|©|u|t|i|n|a|l|l|i|Î|a|Ô|k|ù|c|a|r|a|t|u |t|a|n|t|a|i|y|e|≠|i|≠, |õ|ü|p|a|t|‡|m. |p|i|ü|a|v|u|m|a|≠|≠|a.

