<|P><|B>((|V|I|R|I)):</|B> |i|≠|≠|a|t|a|ü|k|u |i|≠|≠|a|t|u |e|c|c|a|m|e|≠|ü|u |m|o|©|i|n|t|i|l|‡|t|‡|r|t|a|t|t|a|m|e|c|c|a|m|e|≠|ü|u |k|u|ü|i|t|t|u|r|a|i|t|t|a|v|‡|ü|u |e|≠|≠|a|i|y|ù |v|e|≠|i|≠|a. |a|´|t|õ! |n|a|≠|ü|u|c|o|≠|≠|‡|y; |a|v|a|ü|ü|a|i|p |p|a|ı|p|u|t|t|o|k|a|i|p |p|u|ü|a|t|t|u|p|p|i|ü|a|n|t|a|a|≠|m|o|©|i|t|t|o|k|a|i|y|‡|k|a|k|a|k|k|o|Î|Î|a|t |t|‡|m|õ |v|i|Î|a|Ô|k|u|t|a|l|i|≠, |a|v|v|‡|ü|õ |c|o|≠|≠|‡|r|e|≠|k|a.|a|´|t|‡|v|a|t|u, |p|e|y|a|r|‡|k|i|y|a |e|c|c|a|t|t|a|i|y|u|Ò|a|i|y|a|t|u |y|‡|t|u |a|t|u |p|e|y|a|r|e|c|c|a|m|e|≠|p|a|t|u.|p|i|ü|a|v|u|m|a|≠|≠|a.
|p|e|y|a|r|e|c|c|a|m|u|m |v|i|≠|a|i|y|e|c|c|a|m|u|m |m|õ|l|õ |c|o|l|l|a|p|p|a|Ò|Ò|a|≠|a; |õ|≠|a|i|y|a |i|Ò|a|i|y|i|y|a|l|i|ü|c|o|l|l|a|p|p|a|Ò|u|m; |„|ı|Ò|u |a|v|a|ü|ü|a|i|y|õ |v|õ|ü|e|Ò|u|t|t|ù|t|u|v|a|t|u |e|≠|≠|a|i|y|ù|v|e|≠|i|≠,|a|k|k|u|ü|i|y|‡|≠ |o|t|t|a|≠|a|v|õ|≠|u|m |i|l|a|k|k|a|ı|a|t|t|‡|≠ |v|õ|ü|u|p|‡|Ò|u|Ò|a|i|y|a|≠|a |v|e|≠|k|a.|a|v|v|õ|ü|u|p|‡|Ò|u |a|v|v|a|v|a|ü|ü|i|ü|k|u|k|k|‡|Ò|Ò|u|m |i|l|a|k|k|i|y|a|Ô|k|a|Î|u|Ò|k|‡|ı|k|a.

<|P><|B>|v|a-|ü|u.</|B> "|i|ı|a|r|e|r|i |t|ù|y|v|a|≠|≠|a |v|i|≠|≠|‡ |c|e|y|i|≠|u|m, |p|u|ı|a|r|i|≠|v|e|k|u|Î|‡|m|a|i |n|a|≠|ü|u" (|k|u|ü|a|Î. 308), "|e|ı|ı|e|≠|p|a |v|õ|≠|a|i |y|e|©|u|t|t|e|≠|p|a|v|i|v|v|i|r|a|ı|Ò|u|m, |k|a|ı|ı|e|≠|p|a |v|‡|©|u |m|u|y|i|r|k|k|u" (|k|u|ü|a|Î. 392), "|y|‡|t|a|≠|i|≠|y|‡|t|a|≠|i |≠|„|Ô|k|i|y|‡ |≠|ù|t|a|l, |a|t|a|≠|i |≠|a|t|a|≠|i |≠|i|l|a|≠" (|k|u|ü|a|Î. 341) |e|≠|a|v|a|r|u|m|i|v|a|i |m|u|ü|a|i|y|‡|≠|õ |p|i|ü|a|r |i|≠|≠|‡|c|e|y|i|≠|u|m |t|‡|≠ |v|e|k|u|Î|‡|m|a|i |n|a|≠|ü|e|≠|a|v|u|m,|e|ı|ı|e|≠|p|a |õ|≠|a|i |e|©|u|t|t|e|≠|p|a |u|l|a|k|a|t|t|u|v|‡|©|u|m |u|y|i|r|k|k|e|l|l|‡|m |k|a|ı|ı|e|≠|p|a|k|a|ü|ü|‡|r|e|≠|a|v|u|m, |y|‡|t|a|≠|i|≠ |y|‡|t|a|≠|i|≠ |n|„|Ô|k|i|y|‡|≠ |o|r|u|v|a|≠ |n|ù|t|a|l |a|t|a|≠|i|≠ |a|t|a|≠|i|≠|i|l|a|≠|e|≠|a|v|u|m |i|v|v|‡|ü|u |e|§|c|i|y|a |p|e|y|a|r|k|o|ı|Ò|u |m|u|Ò|i|t|a|l|i|ü |p|e|y|a|r|e|c|c|a|m|‡|y|i|≠|a.

<|P>"|k|‡|l|a|Ô |k|a|r|u|t|i |y|i|r|u|p|p|a|r |k|a|l|a|Ô|k|‡|t|u, |§|‡|l|a|Ô |k|a|r|u|t|u |p|a|v|a|r" (|k|u|ü|a|Î.485), "|v|õ|ı|Ò|i|≠|u|ı |Ò|‡|k|a|t |t|u|ü|a|k|k|a |t|u|ü|a|n|t|a|p|i|≠, |„|ı|Ò|u|y|a|ü |p|‡|l|a |p|a|l|a"(|k|u|ü|a|Î. 342), "|n|u|ı|m|‡ |ı|u|©|a|i|p|u|l|a |m|i|l|l|‡ |≠|e|©|i|≠|a|l|a, |m|a|ı|m|‡|≠|p|u|≠|a|i|p|‡|v|a|i|y|a|ü|ü|u" (|k|u|ü|a|Î. 407) |e|≠|a|v|a|r|u|m |i|v|a|i |m|u|ü|a|i|y|‡|≠|õ |k|o|Î|Î|u|Ô|k|‡|l|a|m|k|u|ü|i|t|t|u|k |k|a|l|a|Ô|k|‡|t|i|r|u|p|p|a|r |§|‡|l|a|Ô|k|a|r|u|t|u|p|a|v|a|r|e|≠|a|v|u|m,|u|y|y|a|v|õ|ı|Ò|i|ü|k|‡|l|a|m|u|ı|Ò|‡|k|a|t|t|u|ü|a|k|k|a, |t|u|ü|a|n|t|a|p|i|≠ |i|p|p|i|ü|a|p|p|i|l |u|y|y|a|ü|p|‡|l|a|≠|a|p|a|l|a|v|e|≠|a|v|u|m, |n|u|ı|ı|a|ü|i|v|i|l|l|‡|t|‡|≠ |e|©|i|l |n|a|l|a|≠ |m|a|ı|p|u|≠|a|i |m|‡|ı|p|‡|v|a|i |e|©|i|l|n|a|l|a|m |e|ü|ü|u |a|ü|ü|e|≠|a|v|u|m |v|i|≠|a|i|y|u|m |v|i|≠|a|i|y|u|Î|a|Ò|a|Ô|k|u|m |v|i|≠|a|i|k|k|u|ü|i|p|p|u|Ô|k|o|ı|Ò|u|m|u|Ò|i|t|a|l|i|≠, |v|i|≠|a|i|y|e|c|c|a|m|‡|y|i|≠|a. |a|´|t|õ|l, "|e|Î|Î|‡|m|a|i |v|õ|ı|Ò|u|v|‡ |≠|e|≠|p|‡|≠|e|≠|a|i|t|t|o|≠|ü|u|m, |k|a|Î|Î|‡|m|a|i |k|‡|k|k|a|t|a|≠ |≠|e|§|c|u" (|k|u|ü|a|Î. 281) |e-|m,"|c|i|ü|u|v|a|r|a|i|y|õ |y|‡|y|i|≠|u|§ |c|e|y|t|a|n|a|≠ |ü|a|l|l|‡|l, |u|ü|u|p|a|y|a|≠|ù |v|i|l|l|a|i |y|u|y|i|r|k|k|u"(|n|‡|l|a|Ò|i. 130) |e-|m |v|a|r|u|m |i|v|a|i |t|a|≠|≠|a|i |e|Î|Î|‡|m|a|i|v|õ|ı|Ò|u|v|‡|≠|e|≠|p|‡|≠ |k|a|Î|Î|‡|m|a|i|k|‡|k|k|a |t|a|≠ |n|e|§|c|e|≠|a|v|u|m, |t|a|≠|≠|‡|ü|c|e|y|y|a|p|p|a|Ò|Ò|a |n|a|≠|ü|a|l|l|a|t|u |u|y|i|r|k|k|u|u|ü|u|p|a|y|a|≠|i|l|l|a|i |y|e|≠|a|v|u|m |u|r|u|p|u|c|c|o|ü|k|a|Î |e|§|c|a|v|a|n|t|a|≠|a, |e|p|p|‡|ü|p|a|Ò|u|m|ù|v|e|≠|i|≠, |u|r|u|p|u|c|c|o|ü|k|a|Î|u|m |v|i|≠|a|i |v|i|≠|a|i|k|k|u|ü|i|p|p|‡|y|a|Ò|a|Ô|k|u|t|a|l|i|≠,|v|i|≠|a|i|y|e|c|c|a|t|t|i|≠|p|‡|ü|p|a|Ò|u|m|e|≠|k|a.

<|P>|`|t|a|≠|≠|a|i' |e|≠|ü|a|t|u, |t|‡|≠|a|Ò|a|k|k|u|m |o|©|u|Ô|k|a|i|y|e|≠|a|v|u|m, |`|t|a|≠|≠|‡|l' |e|≠|ü|a|t|u,|t|a|≠ |t|o|©|i|l|i|≠|‡|l|e|≠|a|v|u|m |v|i|≠|a|i |v|i|≠|a|i|k|k|u|ü|i|p|p|i|≠|‡|l |v|i|Î|a|Ô|k|u|t|a|l|‡|l,|e|Ò|Ò|u|r|u|p|u|m|õ|ü|ü|a |c|o|ü|k|a|Î|u|m |v|i|≠|a|i |v|i|≠|a|i|k|k|u|ü|i|p|p|e|≠|ü|a|ü|i|k|a.

<|P>"|i|l|a|Ô|k|u|v|‡ |Î|i|r|a|ı|Ò|i|≠|‡ |l|i|r|u|k|a|i|v|„ |c|i|p|p|e|y|a|r|n, |t|a|l|a|Ô|k|a|≠|m|‡|l|a|i|i|y|a |v|i|©|n|t|‡|Ò|a|v|‡ |Ò|u|m|m|i|v|a|Î", "|k|a|Ò|u|v|a|≠ |m|u|t|u|m|a|k|a|≠ |k|a|l|l|‡ |m|Â|l|a|ü|k|u, |v|a|t|u|v|a|i |v|a|n|t|a|v|a|≠|p|a|ü|a|©|k |k|u|m|a|r|i, |i|r|u|t|ù |Ò|ù|©|a|r |p|a|ü|ü|a" |e|≠|a|v|a|r|u|m |i|v|a|i, |i|r|u|k|a|i|y|u|m|v|„|c|i|y|e|≠|a|v|u|m |i|r|u|t|ù|Î|u|m |p|a|ü|ü|a|v|e|≠|a|v|u|m |u|m|m|a|i|k|o|ı|Ò|u |m|u|Ò|i|t|a|l|i|≠,|u|m|m|a|i|y|e|c|c|a|m|‡|y|i|≠|a.

<|P>"|p|Â|ı|Ò|a, |m|i|Ò|i|y|e|≠|≠|u|Ô |k|‡|r|a|ı|a|t|t|i|≠ |m|õ|≠|m|u|ü|a|i|k |k|a|ı|ı|õ, |k|a|Ò|i|y|e|≠|ü|‡|r|k|a|ü|ü|a|ü|i|n |t|‡|r" (|n|‡|l|a|Ò|i. 56, "|c|e|y|y|„|r|ù |v|e|≠|≠|‡|≠|u |m|e|≠|≠|u|§|c|o|ü |k|i|≠|≠|‡|t|õ,|p|a|i|y|a|t|t|‡|§ |c|e|l|l|u|n|e|ü|i" (|n|‡|l|a|Ò|i. 309), "|k|a|i|m|m|‡|l|a|i |y|i|Ò|Ò|u|k |k|a|l|u|©|n|t|‡|Ò|u|ı|a|i|y|i|l|l|‡|r|k, |k|i|m|m|‡|l|a|i |y|e|≠ |c|e|y|v|a |t|e|≠|ü|u" (|n|‡|l|a|Ò|i. 111) |e|≠|a|v|a|r|u|m|i|v|a|i, |k|a|Ò|i|y|e|≠|ü|u |c|o|≠|≠|‡|r|e|≠|a|v|u|m, |c|e|y|y|„|r|ù|v|e|≠|≠|‡|≠|u |m|e|≠|ü|u|c|o|l|l|u|m|c|o|ü|k|e|≠|a|v|u|m, |i|m|m|‡|l|a|i |e|≠|c|e|y|v|a|t|e|≠|ü|u |c|o|l|l|i|y|e|≠|a|v|u|m, |i|c|a|i|y|‡ |v|o|r|u|p|o|r|u|Î|i|l|l|e|≠|ü|u |c|o|l|l|u|t|a|l|e|≠|a|v|u|m |c|o|l|l|e|≠|p|a|t|u |k|o|ı|Ò|u|m|u|Ò|i|t|a|l|i|≠, |c|o|l|l|e|c|c|a|m|‡|y|i|≠|a.
"|a|ü|i|m|i |≠|a|ü|a|n|e|ü|i |y|a|§|c|u|m|i|≠ |k|Â|ü|ü|a|m, |p|o|ü|u|m|i|≠ |p|i|ü|a|r|k|a|Ò|u|§|c|o|ü|p|ù|ü|ü|u|m|i|≠|v|a|§|c|a|m, |v|e|ü|u|m|i|≠ |v|i|≠|a|i|t|„|y|‡|r |k|õ|ı|m|a|i|y|e|§ |§|‡|≠|ü|u|m, |p|e|ü|u|m|i|≠ |p|e|r|i|y|ù|r|v|‡|y|c|c|o|l" (|n|‡|l|a|Ò|i. 172),  |e|≠|≠|u|m |i|t|a|≠|u|Î, |o|r|u|v|a|©|i|n|i|≠|ü|a|e|§|§|‡|≠|ü|u|m|e|≠|ü|a|t|a|≠|a|i|p|p|i|r|i|t|t|u|p |p|i|ü|a|v|a|©|i|y|u|m |k|Â|Ò|Ò|i |m|u|Ò|i|k|k|a|v|õ|ı|Ò|u|t|a|l|i|ü|p|i|r|i|n|i|l|a|i |e|c|c|a|m|‡|y|i|ü|ü|u; |i|t|a|≠|a|i |v|i|Î|a|k|k|u|m|e|≠|p|a.

<|P>"|e|Ò|u|t|t|a|l|u|m |p|a|Ò|u|t|t|a|l|u |m|‡|y|i|r|a|ı |Ò|a|l|l|a|t|u, |n|a|l|i|t|a |l|i|l|l|a|i|y|e|≠|m|a|r|u|m|u|Î|a|r|õ", "|v|„|Ò|u|ı|a|r|n |t|ù|r|k|k|u|m |v|i|y|a|p|p|‡|m|‡ |l|i|n|n|i|≠|ü|a, |v|‡|Ò|a|≠|m|u|t|i|y|‡|Î |v|a|y|i|ü|ü|i|Ò|a|Ô-|k|Â|Ò|‡|r, |p|e|r|u|m|p|a|Ò|a|i |v|e|Î|Î|a |n|e|r|i|t|a|r|a|v|u|m |p|õ|r|‡,|i|r|u|m|p|u|l|i |c|õ|r|n|t|a|v|i|Ò|a|m" (|p|u. |v|e. 3:19) |e|≠|a|v|a|r|u|m |i|v|a|i, |e|Ò|u|t|t|a|l|u|m|p|a|Ò|u|t|t|a|l|u|m|e|≠|a |a|v|v|i|r|a|ı|Ò|a|l|l|a|t|e|≠|a|v|u|m, |i|r|u|m|p|u|l|i |c|õ|r|n|t|a |i|Ò|a|m|e|≠|a|v|i|y|a|p|p|‡|m|‡ |l|e|≠|a|v|u|m |e|≠|a|v|e|≠|p|a|t|u |k|o|ı|Ò|u|m|u|Ò|i|t|a|l|i|≠, |e|≠|a|v|e|≠|e|c|c|a|m|‡|y|i|≠|a.
"|c|e|ü|u|n|a|r|a|i|k |k|‡|ı|i|ü |c|u|m|a|k|k|a |v|i|ü|u|v|a|r|a|i, |k|‡|ı|i|ü |k|i|©|a|k|k|‡|n |t|a|l|a|i"(|k|u|ü|a|Î. 488), "|i|≠|≠|‡ |c|e|y|i|≠|u |m|i|≠|i|y|a |v|o|©|i|k|e|≠|ü|u, |t|a|≠|≠|a|i|y|õ |t|‡|≠|ù|v|i|≠|a|l|l|a|t|u - |t|u|≠|≠|i|k, |k|a|l|a|n|t|‡|r|a|i|k |k|a|i|v|i|Ò|u|t|a|l |k|‡|≠|a|k|a |n|‡|Ò|a, |v|i|l|a|Ô|k|i|ü|k|u|m|v|i|Î|Î|a |l|a|r|i|t|u" (|n|‡|l|a|Ò|i. 76) |e|≠|a|v|a|r|u|m |i|v|a|i |k|i|©|a|k|k|‡|n|t|a|l|a|i|y|e|≠|p|a|t|a|≠|t|u|ı|i|p|u|t|ù|≠|ü|u|t|a|ü|k|u |o|©|i|k|k|a|p|p|a|Ò|Ò|a |a|v|a|r|k|e|Ò|u|v|a|r|e|≠|p|a|t|a|i|y|u|m,|k|a|l|a|n|t|‡|r|a|i|k|k|a|i|v|i|Ò|u|t|a|l |a|r|u|m|a|i|t|ù|≠|ü|u|t|a|ü|k|u |o|©|i|k|k|a|p|p|a|Ò|Ò|a|m|a|k|k|a|Ò|k|e|Î|i|t|ù|v|e|≠|p|a|t|a|i|y|u|m |k|o|ı|Ò|u|m|u|Ò|i|t|a|l|i|≠, |o|©|i|y|i|c|a|i |y|e|c|c|a|m|‡|y|i|≠|a.|i|c|a|i|y|e|≠|p|a|t|u|c|o|l.

<|P>"|p|i|ü|a|v|i|p |p|e|r|u|Ô|k|a|Ò|a |≠|„|n|t|u|v|a|r |n|„|n|t|‡|r, |i|ü|a|i|v|a |≠|a|Ò|i|c|õ|r|‡ |t|‡|r"(|k|u|ü|a|Î. 10), "|k|Â|t|t|‡|Ò |Ò|a|v|a|i|k|k|u|©|‡|t |t|a|ü|ü|õ |p|e|r|u|§|c|e|l|v|a|m,|p|ù|k|k|u|m|a|t|u|v|i|Î|i|n |t|a|ü|ü|u" (|k|u|ü|a|Î. 332), "|n|õ|r|a|l|l|‡|r |n|„|r|a|l|l|a |c|o|l|l|i|y|a|k|k|‡|≠|m|a|ü|ü|a|t|u, |t|‡|r|i|t |t|i|r|u|t|t|a |ü|a|k|u|t|i|m|a|ü - |ü|ù|r|u|m, |p|u|k|a|©|m|a|i|y|‡|k |k|o|Î|Î|‡|t|u|p|o|Ô|k|u|n|„|r |§|‡|l|a|m, |c|a|m|a|©|m|a|i|y|‡|k |k|o|ı|Ò|u |v|i|Ò|u|m" (|n|‡|l|a|Ò|i. 72) |e|≠|a |v|a|r|u|m|i|v|a|i, |c|õ|r|n|t|‡|r |n|„|n|t|u|v|a|r|e|≠|a|v|u|m, |k|Â|t|t|‡|Ò|Ò|a|v|a|i|k |k|u|©|‡|t|t|u |v|a|r|a|v|u |e|ü|ü|u|a|ü|ü|u |a|v|a|r|p|e|ü|ü|a |p|e|r|u|§|c|e|l|v|a|t|t|u |v|a|r|a|v|e|≠|a|v|u|m, |t|‡|r|i|t|t|i|r|‡|t|u |v|e|k|u|Ò|a|l|p|u|k|a|©|m|a|i|y|‡|k|a|k|k|o|Î|Î|‡|t|e|≠|a|v|u|m |i|v|a|ü|ü|u |e|t|i|r|m|a|ü|a|i |k|o|ı|Ò|u |m|u|Ò|i|t|a|l|i|≠,|e|t|i|r|m|a|ü|a|i |y|e|c|c|a|m|‡|y|i|≠|a.

<|P>|i|≠|i |i|c|a|i|y|e|c|c|a|m|‡|v|a|t|u, |o|≠|ü|u|c|o|l|l|a |a|c|c|o|l|l|‡|≠|õ |v|õ|ü|o|r|u |p|o|r|u|Î|i|c|a|i|t|t|a|l.|a|´|t|‡|v|a|t|u |i|r|a|Ò|Ò|u|ü|a |m|o|©|i|t|a|l|e|≠|ü|a|v|‡|ü|u; "|u|§|c|a|i |y|a|r|a|c|a |≠|o|r|u|m|a|k|a|≠|ü|ù|©|a|≠|ü|a|≠, |n|e|§|c|i|ü |k|i|≠|i|y|‡ |≠|e|ü|i|t|t|u|ı|a|i |y|‡|k|k|o|ı|Ò|u, |p|a|n|t|e|ü|i |p|‡|ı|i|y|a|p|‡|y|p|a|r|i |m|‡|v|o|Ò|u, |v|a|n|t|a|≠|a |≠|a|Ò|i|v|a|l|a|§ |c|e|y|v|a|t|a|ü |k|e|≠|ü|‡|≠", "|v|a|n|t|a|v|a|r|a|v|e|≠|≠|a|i|y|e|≠|a |v|‡|Ò|k|a|ı|m|a|Ò|a |v|‡|y|k|õ|Î, |c|i|n|t|a|i|n|a|l|i |k|i|≠|ü|a|t|i|r|u|n|„|r|k|k|u|m|a|r|i|y|‡|Ò|a, |v|a|n|t|i|l|a|t|i |≠|‡|y|a|p|a|y|a |≠|e|≠|≠|a|i|m|o|©|i|k|e|≠|ü|‡|Î, |m|u|n|t|a|i|n|a|l|i|k|i|≠|ü|a|m|u|t|u |m|Â|p|p|o|©|i|y|u |m|e|≠|ü|‡|≠" (|c|„|v|a|k|a. 2020) |e|≠|a|v|a|r|u|m|i|v|a|i, |i|c|c|o|≠|≠|a|p|o|r|u|Î|o|©|i|y|a |v|õ|ü|u |i|c|a|i|n|t|a|p|o|r|u|Î |k|o|ı|Ò|u |m|u|Ò|i|t|a|l|i|≠, |i|c|a|i|y|e|c|c|a|m|‡|y|i|≠|a.|i|t|a|i|c |c|i|l|õ|Ò|a|i|y|u|m|e|≠|p|a.


<|P>"|p|„|l|i|p|e|y |c|‡|k|‡|Ò|u |m|a|c|c|i|ü|u |m|a|p|p|a|ı|Ò|a|m, |c|‡|l|a |m|i|k|u|t|t|u|p |p|e|y|i|≠"(|k|u|ü|a|Î. 475), "|k|a|Ò|a|l|ù|Ò|‡ |k|‡|l|v|a |≠|e|Ò|u|n|t|õ|r |k|a|Ò|a|l|ù|Ò|u, |n|‡|v|‡|y|u |m|ù|Ò|‡|n|i|l|a|t|t|u" (|k|u|ü|a|Î. 496), "|m|‡|v|e|≠|a |m|a|Ò|a|l|u |m|Â|r|p|a |p|Â|v|e|≠|a|k,|k|u|v|i|m|u|k|i|©|e|r|u|k|k|a|Ô |k|a|ı|ı|i|y|u|§ |c|Â|Ò|u|p|a, |m|a|ü|u|k|i |≠|‡|r|k|k|a|v|u|m |p|a|Ò|u|p|a, |p|i|ü|i|t|u|m|‡|k|u|p|a |k|‡|m|a|Ô|k|‡|© |k|o|Î|i|≠|õ" (|k|u|ü|u|n. 17) |e|≠|u|m|i|v|a|i |m|u|ü|a|i|y|õ, |m|e|l|i|y|a|r|u|m|p|a|l|a|r |t|o|k|i|≠, |v|a|l|i|y|a|r|‡|k|u|p|a; |i|v|v|i|Ò|a|m |i|v|a|r|k|k|u|c|c|e|l|l|u|m, |i|v|v|i|Ò|a|m|i|v|a|r|k|k|u|c|c|e|l|l|‡|t|e|≠|a |a|v|v|a|v|a|r|k|k|õ|ü|ü|a |i|Ò|a|≠|a|ü|i|n|t|u |k|a|r|u|m|a|m |k|o|Î|k|a; |y|‡|≠|u|m|a|v|v|a|ı|ı|a|m |c|e|y|v|õ|≠|e|≠|a|k |k|u|ü|i|t|t|a |p|o|r|u|Î|k|o|ı|Ò|u |m|u|Ò|i|t|a|l|i|ü|k|u|ü|i|p|p|e|c|c|a|m|‡|y|i|≠|a. |i|t|a|≠|a|i |n|u|v|a|l|‡|n|u|v|a|ü|c|i|y|u|m|e|≠|p|a. |p|i|ü|a|v|u|m|a|≠|≠|a.


<|P>|i|n|t|a|p |p|a|t|t|e|c|c|a|m|u|m, |p|u|v|i|p|u|k|a|© |p|u|l|a|m|a|i |y|a|v|i|≠|a|y|a |≠|Â|l|u|Ò |Ò|a|ı|Ò|a|l|a|Ô|k|i|©|a|v|a|≠ |n|a|k|a|i|v|a|r|u |n|õ|m|i |y|e|ı|Ò|i|c|a|i |n|i|ü|a|i|p|e|y|a |r|i|r|‡|c|a |p|a|v|i|t|t|i|r|a|p|p|a|l|l|a|v|a |t|a|r|a|i|y|a|≠ |p|a|k|a|r|c|c|i|y|e|≠ |ü|a|ü|i|k|a.

<|P>|i|≠|i, |i|v|a|ü|ü|a|i |i|v|v|‡|ü|a|≠|ü|i |v|i|≠|a|i|y|i|y|a|l|u|Î|Î|u|m|i|Ò|a|i|c|c|o|l|l|i|y|a|l|u|Î|Î|u|m|o|©|i|n|t|a|≠|a|v|‡|k|k|i, |u|ı|Ò|a|c|‡|t|t|a|≠, |u|ı|ı|u|§|c|‡|t|t|a|≠;|u|ı|Ò|a|v|Â|ı, |u|ı|ı|u|m|Â|ı|e|≠|p|a|≠|a |p|e|y|a|r|e|c|c|a|m; |t|a|m|p|e|y|a|r |k|o|ı|Ò|a|≠|a. |u|©|u|t|u|v|a|n|t|‡|≠,|m|a|r|u|n|t|u|ı|Ò|u|n|a|l|l|a|≠|‡|y|i|≠|‡|≠, |u|©|u|t|u |v|a|r|u|t|a|l|e|≠|p|a|≠|a |v|i|≠|a|i|y|e|c|c|a|m; |v|i|≠|a|i|y|u|m|k|u|ü|i|p|p|u|m |v|i|≠|a|i|p|p|e|y|a|r|u|m |k|o|ı|Ò|a|≠|a. |c|‡|t|t|a|≠|u|m |v|a|n|t|‡|≠|e|≠|p|a|t|u|u|m|m|a|i|y|e|c|c|a|m; |k|o|ü|ü|a|≠|u|m |v|a|n|t|‡|≠|e|≠|a|t |t|a|≠|≠|e|c|c|a|Ô |k|o|ı|Ò|a|t|u. "|p|a|c|i|t|t|õ|≠|p|a|©|a|§|c|ù|ü|u |t|‡|v|e|≠|ü|u |n|i|≠|ü|‡|Î, |n|u|c|u|p|p|ù|v|u|l|a|k|a|m |p|e|ü|u|m" |e|≠|p|a|t|u |c|o|l|l|e|c|c|a|m:|i|t|u |t|‡|v|e|≠|ü|u |c|o|l|l|i|n|i|≠|ü|‡|Î|e|≠|a|c |c|o|l|l|i |y|e|≠|p|a|t|a|≠|a|i|k |k|o|ı|Ò|a|t|u. |a|v|a|≠|ù|k|o|ı|Ò|‡|≠; |a|v|a|≠|õ |k|o|ı|Ò|‡|≠|e|≠|p|a|≠|a |p|i|r|i|n|i|l|a|i|y|e|c|c|a|m; |i|v|a|i |o|r|u |k|u|©|u|v|i|ü|p|i|r|i|k|k|a|p|p|a|Ò|Ò|‡|≠|a|i|y|õ |k|o|ı|Ò|a|≠|a. |k|o|Î|Î|e|≠|a|k |k|o|ı|Ò|‡|≠|e|≠|p|a|t|u |e|≠|a|v|e|≠|e|c|c|a|m;|i|t|u |k|o|ı|Ò|‡|≠|e|≠|≠|u|m |v|i|≠|a|i |k|o|ı|Ò|a|t|u. |k|o|Î|Î|e|≠|p|a|t|u |m|u|ü|ü|u; |a|t|u|m|u|ü|ü|õ|l|‡|m|a|i|y|i|≠, |i|ü|u|t|i |e|≠|a|v|e|≠|p|a|t|u |m|u|ü|ü|u|k|k|o|ı|Ò|a|t|u. |o|©|i|y|i|c|a|i|y|e|c|c|a|m|‡|v|a|t|u, |m|a|≠|≠|u|m |t|i|l|l|u|m |ù|v|u|m|e|≠|u|m|Â|≠|ü|u|m; |a|v|a|i: |p|a|ı|Ò|u |k|Â|r|i|y|a|t|ù|r|v|‡|ı|m|a|≠|e|≠|p|a|t|u |i|p|p|ù|t|u |k|ù|Ò|i|ü|ü|u, |i|ü|ü|a|t|e|≠|p|a|v|a|ü|ü|a|i|y|u|m, "|v|a|r|u|k|a|t|i|l|l|a|m|m|a" (|a|k|a|n|‡. 276) |e|≠|p|a|t|u |v|a|n|t|‡|l |i|≠|≠|a|t|o|≠|ü|u |c|e|y|v|a|l|e|≠|p|a|t|a|≠|a|i|y|u|m,|k|o|Î|a|l|ù |k|o|ı|Ò|‡|≠|e|≠|p|a|t|u |k|o|ı|Ò|u|y|y|a|p |p|ù|y|i|≠|‡|≠|a|l|l|a |≠|e|≠|p|a|t|a|≠|a|i|y|u|m |k|o|ı|Ò|u|m|u|Ò|i|n|t|a|≠|a. |e|t|i|r|m|a|ü|a|i |y|e|c|c|a|m |i|r|a|ı|Ò|u; |ù|k|‡|r|a |v|e|t|i|r|m|a|ü|a|i, |u|m|m|a|i|y|e|t|i|r|m|a|ü|a|i |y|e|≠|a. |y|‡|≠|ù|k|o|ı|Ò|õ|≠|e|≠|p|a|t|u |y|‡|≠ |k|o|ı|Ò|i|l|a|≠|e|≠|p|a|t|a|i|y|u|m,|v|a|r|a|l|u|m|u|r|i|y|a|≠|e|≠|p|a|t|u |v|a|r|‡|m|a|i|k|k|u|m|u|r|i|y|a|≠|e|≠|p|a|t|a|i|y|u|m |k|o|ı|Ò|u |m|u|Ò|i|t|a|l|i|≠|e|t|i|r|m|a|ü|a|i |y|e|c|c|a|m, |o|l|l|e|≠|a |v|o|l|i|t|t|a|t|e|≠|p|a|t|u |o|l|l|e|≠|ü|a |a|n|u|k|a|r|a|ı|a |ù|c|a|i|y|õ|i|c|a|i|t|t|a|t|e|≠|ü|u |m|u|Ò|i|t|a|l|i|≠, |i|c|a|i|y|e|c|c|a|m. |v|i|ı|ı|e|≠|a |v|i|c|a|i|t|t|a|t|e|≠|p|a|t|u|v|i|ı|ı|e|≠|ü|a|t|õ |v|i|c|a|i|t|t|a|t|e|≠|ü|u |m|u|Ò|i|t|a|l|i|ü |k|u|ü|i|p|p|e|c|c|a|m; "|c|a|l|a|Ô|k|o|ı|Ò|a|n|ù|y|i|≠|n|ù|v|u|v|i|ı|ı|e|≠|a|t |t|e|ü|i|t|t|a|l |c|e|y|y|u|m" |e|≠|≠|u|Ô |k|u|ü|i|p|p|i|≠|‡|≠, |v|i|ı|ı|e|≠|ü|a|t|u|k|u|ü|i|p|p|e|c|c|a|m|‡|y|i|ü|ü|e|≠|ü|u |i|v|v|‡|ü|u |c|o|l|l|u|v|a|r.

<|P>|i|´|t|u |o|l|k|‡|p |p|u|l|a|m|a|i|t |t|o|l|k|‡|p|p|i|y|a|t|t|u|Î |u|Î|a|Ô|k|Â|r|k|õ|Î|v|i |i|Î|a|m|p|Â|r|a|ı|a|r|e|≠|u|m |õ|t|a|m|i|≠|m|‡|t|a|v|a|r |ù|t|i|y|a|v|u|r|a|i |~|e|≠|ü|u|ı|a|r|k|a.

