<|P><|B>((|W|F|W)):</|B> |i|t|t|o|©|i|l|k|a|Î|i|l|l|a|≠|a|v|u|m |u|Î|Î|a|≠|a|p|ù|l|a |a|´|ü|i|ı|a|i|y|i|Ò|a|t|t|u|m|c|o|l|l|a|p|p|e|ü|u|m |e-|ü|u.

<|P><|B>((|V|I|R|I)):</|B> |v|a-|ü|u. "|n|a|≠|≠|„|r|a|i |v|‡|©|i |y|a|≠|i|c|c|a|m|õ |n|i|≠|≠|i|≠|u,|m|e|≠|≠|„|r|a|Î |y|‡|m|v|„|© |p|a|v|a|Î" (|k|u|ü|a|Î. 1111), "|k|a|r|a|v|a|l|a|m|e|≠ |ü|ù|r|a|i|k |k|a|ı|Ò|a|t|i|l|a|i|y|ù, |i|r|a|v|e|l|‡ |n|i|≠|ü|‡|y|‡ |l|„|r|Ô|k|a|t|i|r|t |t|i|Ô|k|‡|Î" ("|a|r|a|v|a|Î|a|i|m|e|≠|ü|ù|Î" -|t|o|l. |k|a|Î|a. 42, |n|a) |e-|m, "|p|a|k|a|i|y|u |m|u|v|a|k|a|i|y|u|Ô |k|a|ı|ı|u|r|a|i|k|k|u|m"(|p|a|k|a|i|m|a|i|y|u|Ô |k|õ|ı|m|a|i|y|u|Ô |k|a|ı|ı|u|r|a|i|k|k|u|m; (|k|u|ü|a|Î. 709), "|m|‡|y|t|a|l|u|m|p|i|ü|a|t|t|a|l|u|m |v|a|Î|a|r|n|t|u |v|„|Ô|k|a|l|u|m, |t|õ|y|t|a|l|u |m|u|Ò|a|i|m|a|i|y|a|i|t |t|i|Ô|k|a|Î|c|e|p|p|u|m|‡|l" (|c|„|v|a|k|a. 2932), |n|i|l|a|m |v|a|l|l|e|≠|ü|a|t|u, |n|„|r |t|a|ı|ı|e|≠|ü|a|t|u |e-|m,|i|n|n|e|ü|i |i|≠|≠|a|v|Â|r|k|k|u|c|c|e|l|l|u|m, |i|m|m|a|l|a|i |i|≠|≠|u|©|i|v|a|n|t|u|k|i|Ò|a|k|k|u|m, |k|a|Ò|a|l|i|t|t|u|ı|a|i |‡|©|n|t|u|k|i|Ò|a|k|k|u|m, |n|i|l|a|m |i|t|t|u|ı|a|i |a|k|a|≠|ü|u|k|i|Ò|a|k|k|u|m |e-|m, "|t|a|≠|≠|e|§|c|a|ü|i|v|a|t|u |p|o|y|y|a|ü|k|a |p|o|y|t|t|a|p|i|≠, |t|a|≠|≠|e|§|c|õ |t|a|≠|≠|a|i|c|c|u|Ò|u|m" (|k|u|ü|a|Î|a.293), "|v|a|ı|c|i|ü|a|i|p |p|a|v|a|Î|a|c |c|e|v|v|‡|y|p |p|e|Ò|a|i|y|a|≠|a |m|a|Ò|a|m|a|i |k|Â|r|a|t, |t|a|≠|k|a|y|a|n|„|r|u|Ò |k|a|ı|Ò|a |t|a|≠|≠|i|©|a|l |p|i|ü|i|t|e|≠ |ü|e|ı|ı|i|k, |k|a|ı|Ò|a|≠|a|Ô |k|a|Î|v|a |m|a|ü|ü|u|≠ |k|‡|t|a|l|i|t|a|≠|≠|a|i |n|„|r|k|k|„|©|p, |p|a|ı|Ò|a|i|y|a |m|a|l|l|a|m |v|õ|ı|Ò|‡ |p|a|Ò|u|k|k|a|v|e|≠ |ü|Â|Ò|i|ü |ü|a|≠|ü|õ"(|c|„|v|a|k|a. 1623), "|k|a|r|u|v|i|r|a|ü |c|e|m|m|u|k|a |v|e|ı|p|a|ü|c|Â|≠ |m|a|n|t|i, |p|a|r|u|v|i|r|a|l|‡|ü|p|a|i|§|c|u|≠|a|i|n|„|r |t|Â|u|y|p - |p|e|r|u|v|a|r|a|i |m|õ|ü, |ü|õ|≠|ü|õ|v|a|r|k |k|ù|k|k|u |m|a|l|a|i|n|‡|Ò|a|v|‡|r|a|l|ù, |v|‡|≠|ü|õ|v|a|r |k|o|Ò|k|u|m |v|a|©|i" (|t|i|ı|a|i|m|‡. 10) |e-|m |m|u|ü|a|i|y|õ |k|‡|ı|k|a.|p|i|ü|a|v|u|m|a|≠|≠|a.

