<|P><|B>|e-|≠,</|B> |m|a|r|a|p|u|v|a|©|u|v|a|m|a|i|p|p|u|m |i|v|v|ù|t|t|i|ü|k|u|p |p|u|ü|a|n|a|Ò|a|i|y|u|m|u|ı|a|r|t|t|u|t|a|l |n|u|t|a|l|i|ü|ü|u.

<|P><|B>((|W|F|W)):</|B> |u|r|u|v|a|k|a|m|u|m |u|v|a|m|a|i|y|u|m|e|≠|≠|u|m |i|v|v|a|l|a|Ô|k|‡|r|a|Ô|k|a|Ò|k|u |õ|ü|p|u|©|i|i|r|u|t|i|ı|a|i|y|u|m |t|a|m|m|u|Î |m|a|y|a|Ô|k|a|l|u|m |c|i|≠|a|i|y|u|m|u|t|a|l|u|m |t|a|m|m|u|Î |m|a|y|a|Ô|k|a|l|u|m,|i|v|v|ù|t|t|i|≠|u|Ò |c|o|l|l|‡|t|o|©|i|n|t|a|≠|a|v|u|m |p|ù|ü|ü|i |y|a|ü|i|n|t|u|k|o|Î|k|a |e-|ü|u.

<|P><|B>((|V|I|R|I)):</|B> |v|a-|ü|u. "|t|a|r|u|m|a|≠ |ü|a|ı|ı|a|Î|i |y|‡|ü|ü|a|≠|a |t|„|k|a|i|y|‡|l, |v|a|r|u|ı|a|≠ |k|Â|ü|ü|u|y|i|r|m|‡|ü|ü|a|l|i|≠ |v|‡|m|a|≠|õ, |a|r|u|m|a|i |y|‡|l|a|©|a |k|i|ü|k|a|ı|a|i |y|a|i|n|t|u|Ò|a|i|t, |t|i|r|u|m|a|k|a|≠|ü|i|r|u|m|‡|n|i|l|a |m|a|≠|≠|a|≠|õ" (|c|„|v|a|k|a. 160)|i|´|t|u |u|y|a|r|t|i|ı|a|i|y|u|m |m|u|t|a|l|u|m |m|a|y|a|Ô|k|‡|t|u|v|a|n|t|a |u|r|u|v|a|k|a|m. "|m|u|k|a|n|t|‡ |m|a|r|a|i|m|u|ü|u|v|a|≠ |m|u|l|l|a|i|k|a|ı |ı|„|l|a|m, |i|k|a|n|t|‡|r|v|i|r|a|l|k|‡|n|t|a |Î|e|≠|ü|õ|≠-|ü|u|k|a|n|t|i|y|a|i|n|t|a, |m|‡|©|a|i|m|‡ |v|a|ı|Ò|i|ü|k|‡ |n|„|©|a|l|v|a|r|u|n|t|‡|t|õ, |õ|©|a|i|t|‡ |≠|õ|k|u |m|i|≠|i|t|u" (|t|i|ı|a|i|m|‡. 72.) |i|´|t|u |a|´|ü|i|ı|a|i|y|u|m|c|i|≠|a|i|y|u|m |m|a|y|a|Ô|k|‡|t|u |v|a|n|t|a |u|r|u|v|a|k|a|m. "|m|a|t|i|p|a|v|a|Î|a |m|u|t|t|a|m|u|k|a|m|v|‡|y|m|u|ü|u|v|a|l". |i|t|u |t|i|ı|a|i|m|a|y|a|Ô|k|‡|t|u |m|u|t|a|l|u|m |c|i|≠|a|i|y|u|m |m|a|y|a|Ô|k|i|v|a|n|t|a |u|r|u|v|a|k|a|m. "|m|a|≠|≠|a|r |m|a|Ò|a|Ô|k|a|≠ |m|a|ü|a|i|y|a|v|a|r |c|o|≠|m|‡|l|a|i, |a|≠|≠|a|n|a|Ò|a|i|y|i|≠|‡|r|k |k|‡|r|a|m|u|t|a|m-|t|u|≠|≠|u|m, |p|a|r|i|c|i|l|a|r|k|k|u |v|‡|≠|a|m |p|a|≠|i|m|a|l|a|r|p|p|Â|m|p|a|i|n|t|‡|r, |e|r|i|c|i|≠|a|v|õ|ü|ü|‡|≠|a|i|y|e|Ô|k|ù" (|p|u. |v|e. 9 : 1), "|t|‡|©|i|r|u|n|t|a|Ò|a|k|k|a|i|y|u |m|a|r|u|p|p|u|n |t|a|m|p|i|y|a|r, |t|ù|©|a|r|t|a|≠ |ü|‡|Î|k|a|Î|‡|c |c|o|r|i|y|u |m|u|m|m|a|t|a|m,|‡|©|k|a|Ò|a|ü |c|u|ü|ü|a|m|‡ |v|a|©|a|≠|ü|u |c|„|v|a|k|a, |õ|©|u|y|a|r |p|ù|t|a|k|a |m|i|≠|a|t|t|o |Ò|õ|ü|ü|a|t|õ"(|c|„|v|a|k|a. 775.) |i|v|a|i |u|y|a|r|t|i|ı|a|i |a|´|ü|i|ı|a|i|y|‡|k|a |m|a|y|a|Ô|k|i |v|a|n|t|a |u|r|u|v|a|k|a|m."|p|a|Ò|Ò|a|v|a|r|t |t|a|p|p|a|l|i|ü |p|a|r|a|v|a|i|y|õ|n|t|a|l|k|u|l, |a|Ò|Ò|o|Î|i |y|a|r|a|t|t|a|v|‡|y|k |k|a|ı|i|k|a|i|y|a|l|l|a|t|u, |m|a|Ò|Ò|u|Ò|a|i |m|a|ı|a|m|a|k|a|ı |m|a|l|a|r|n|t|a |p|ù|t|i|≠|‡|ü, |k|a|Ò|Ò|u|Ò|a|i|k |k|‡|v|a|l|i|ü|k|‡|m|a|r |k|a|≠|≠|i|y|õ" (|c|„|v|a|k|a. 99), "|a|k|a|©|k|i|Ò|a|Ô |k|a|n|t|u|k|i |l|‡|r|n|t|a |p|‡|m|p|u|r|i,|p|u|k|a|©|t|a|k|u |m|õ|k|a|l|a|i |n|‡|§|c|i|l |p|Â|ı|m|u|l|a|i, |t|i|k|a|©|m|a|ı|i|k |k|ù|p|u|r|a|n |t|i|Ô|k|a|Î|v|‡|ı|m|u|k|a|m, |c|i|k|a|©|i|k|a|i |n|e|Ò|u|Ô|k|o|Ò|i |c|e|l|v|i|k|k|e|≠|p|a|v|õ" (|c|„|v|a|k|a. 1444) |i|v|a|i|a|´|ü|i|ı|a|i |u|y|a|r|t|i|ı|a|i|y|‡|k|a |m|a|y|a|Ô|k|i |v|a|n|t|a |u|r|u|v|a|k|a|m. |p|i|ü|a|v|u|m|a|≠|≠|a.
"|k|o|Ô|k|a|l|a|r |k|ù|t|a|i|k |k|u|m|a|r|i |m|a|Ò|a|n|a|l|l|‡|Î, |m|a|Ô|k|a|l|a|Ô |k|Â|ü|a |m|a|l|i|p|e|y|t|i|k -|k|a|Ô|k|a|i|y|‡|Î, |p|Â|m|p|a|≠|a |l|‡|k|a|Ô |k|e|©|„|i|y|i|≠|‡|≠ |p|ù|r|a|Ò|u|t|ù|Î, |v|õ|m|p|‡|r |t|e|r|i|y|a|l|e|m|v|õ|n|t|u" (|p|u. |v|e. 9 : 36), "|i|l|a|m|e|≠ |ü|a|c|a|i|i |y|i|r|u|p|p|‡|r|a|i|k |k|‡|ı|i,|≠|i|l|a|m|e|≠|≠|u |n|a|l|l|‡ |ı|a|k|u|m" (|k|u|ü|a|Î. 1040), |v|a|r|u|n|t|i |y|„|≠|ü|‡|ı|m|a|ü|a|n|t|o|©|i|n|t|‡|Î |v|a|Î|a|r|t|t|‡|Î |c|o|ü|k|õ|Ò|Ò|i|l |k|a|Ò|i|n|t|‡|Î, |m|u|r|u|n|t|i|≠ |k|‡|ü|u|Ô|k|Â|©|a|i|y|a|i |m|u|≠|i|v|‡|r |n|i|≠|≠|a|i |y|e|≠|m|u|≠|i|v|‡|r, |p|o|r|u|n|t|i|ü |ü|a|≠|ü|‡ |l|i|t|u|v|e|≠|ü|‡|y|p|o|≠|ü|u |m|a|Î|i|t|t|i|v |v|u|y|i|r|e|≠|≠|‡|y, |t|i|r|u|n|t|u |c|ù|l|a|i|k |k|a|r|u|Ô|k|u|y|i|l|õ |c|i|l|a|m|p|a|v|i|r|u|n|t|u |k|Â|v|u|t|i|y|‡|l" (|c|„|v|a|k|a. 1661) |e|≠|ü|a|ü|ü|o|Ò|a|k|k|a|t|t|a|≠|a|u|r|u|v|a|k|a|v|i|l|a|k|k|a|ı|a|m |v|i|Î|a|Ô|k|a |n|i|≠|ü|i|l|a|v|õ|≠|u|m |a|t|a|≠|i|Ò|a|t|t|u |m|a|y|a|Ô|k|i|n|i|≠|ü|a|≠|a|v|e|≠|a|k |k|o|Î|k|a.
