"|a|t|u|m|a|≠" (|p|u|ü|a|n|‡. 147), "|a|t|u|m|a|ü |ü|a|m|m|a", "|a|t|u|m|a|ü |ü|a|m|m|a|t|‡|≠|õ" |e-|m,"|k|o|≠|≠|Â|r" (|k|u|ü|u|n. 138), "|ù|o |v|u|v|a|m|a |≠|u|ü|a|©|v|i|≠|ü|i" (|k|a|Î|a. 36) |e-|m|p|e|y|a|r|p |p|i|≠|≠|u|m |m|u|≠|≠|u|m |o|≠|ü|u|m |p|a|l|a|v|u|m |v|a|n|t|a|≠|a. "|v|a|r|u|k|a|t|i|l","|v|a|r|u|k|a|t|i |l|a|m|m|a" (|a|k|a|n|‡. 276), "|v|a|r|u|k|a|t|i |l|a|m|m|a |t|‡|≠|õ" (|p|u|ü|a|n|‡.147) |e-|m, "|ù|o |t|a|n|t|‡|r", "|õ|õ |a|m|p|a|≠ |m|o|©|i|n|t|a|≠|a|Î |y|‡|y|õ" |e-|m |v|i|≠|a|i|p|p|i|≠|≠|u|m |m|u|≠|≠|u|m |o|≠|ü|u|m |p|a|l|a|v|u|m |v|a|n|t|a|≠|a. |t|a|≠|i|t|t|u|m |v|a|r|u|Ô|k|o|l|e|≠|≠|u|m|a|i|y|a|m|a|ü|u|t|t|a|ü|k|u, |`|t|a|≠|i|t|t|i|y|a|l|i|≠|ü|i' |e|≠|ü|‡|r|e|≠|k|a.
